//! ============================================================================
//! Land Architecture Documentation
//! ============================================================================
//!
//! This module contains comprehensive documentation about the CodeEditorLand
//! architecture, design decisions, Element analysis, and development process.
//!
//! The content is synthesized from the planning documents in the `plans/`
//! directory, integrated into the codebase for easy reference and to reduce
//! standalone documentation.
//!
//! Sections:
//! - Architecture Overview (from overview.md)
//! - Decision Matrix (from DECISION_MATRIX.md)
//! - Elements Analysis (from ELEMENTS_ANALYSIS.md)
//! - Development Batches (from BATCH_*.md)
//! - Status Tracking (from TODO_STATUS.md, CONVENTION_STATUS.md, etc.)
//! - Integration Plans (from integration/)
//! - Refactoring Guidelines (from refactoring/)
//! - Standalone Deployment (from standalone/)
//! - Product Combinatorics (from combinatorics/)
//! - Workbench Investigations (from workbench/)
//! - Conversation Protocols (from conversation/)
//! - Transport Strategies (from transport/) - actually transport goes to Air
//! - API Design (from api/) - goes to Grove
//! - Variants Specifications (from variants/) - goes to respective Elements
//!
//! Note: Transport, API, and Variants documentation are inserted directly into
//! the respective source modules (Air::Transport, Grove::API, and Element-specific
//! files) rather than here.
//!
