// | terminal   | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ❌                                        | ❌  | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Ready in Cocoon only</span> |
// | env        | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄  | <span style="color:white">Partially Ready</span>        |
// | extensions | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ❌                                        | ❌  | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Ready in Cocoon only</span> |
// 
// ## Spine Integration Impact
// 
// API calls that require Mountain backend (vs. standalone variants):
// 
// | API Method                                   | Requires Mountain                             | Transport                                    | Notes                                                              |
// | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------- |
// | `workspace.fs.readFile()`                    | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span>       | <span style="color:white">gRPC (Vine)</span> | <span style="color:white">Implemented in Cocoon</span>             |
// | `workspace.fs.writeFile()`                   | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span>       | <span style="color:white">gRPC (Vine)</span> | <span style="color:white">Implemented in Cocoon</span>             |
// | `window.createTerminal()`                    | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span>       | <span style="color:white">gRPC (Vine)</span> | <span style="color:white">Implemented in Cocoon</span>             |
// | `env.openExternal()`                         | ❌                                            | N/A                                          | N/A                                                                | Browser-only feature |
// | `window.showQuickPick()`                     | <span style="color:white">Partially ✅</span> | <span style="color:white">gRPC (Vine)</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Stubbed in Cocoon, needs wiring</span> |
// | `languages.registerCompletionItemProvider()` | 🔄                                            | <span style="color:white">gRPC (Vine)</span> | <span style="color:#64bff">Planned</span>                          |
// 
// ## Priority Levels
// 
// | Priority      | Categories                                 | Methods                                                                                       | Target for Phase 1                                                                                                       |
// | ------------- | ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
// | P0 (Critical) | workspace, window, commands, terminal, env | ~60 <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span>, ~20 <span style color="#64b6ff">Planned</span> | Complete all <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> and implement priority <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | P1 (High)     | languages basic (hover, completion)        | ~10                                                                                           | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span>                                                                               |
// | P2 (Medium)   | debug, scm                                 | ~25                                                                                           | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span>                                                                               |
// | P3 (Low)      | languages advanced, extensions API         | ~20                                                                                           | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span>                                                                               |
// 
// ## Extension Compatibility
// 
// | API Category         | Python | Prettier | ESLint | GitLens | Status                                         |
// | -------------------- | ------ | -------- | ------ | ------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
// | workspace.fs         | ✅     | ✅       | ✅     | ✅      | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span>      |
// | window               | ✅     | ✅       | ✅     | ✅      | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span>      |
// | commands             | ✅     | ✅       | ✅     | ✅      | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span>      |
// | languages.hover      | 🔄     | ✅       | 🔄     | ✅      | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span>     |
// | languages.completion | 🔄     | ✅       | 🔄     | 🔄      | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span>     |
// | debug                | ❌     | ❌       | ❌     | ❌      | <span style="color:#64b6ff">All Planned</span> |
// 
// ## Standalone Mode Compatibility
// 
// | API Category     | Mountain Required                       | Browser-Only | PWA | Impact                    |
// | ---------------- | --------------------------------------- | ------------ | --- | ------------------------- |
// | workspace.fs     | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span> | 🔄           | 🔄  | Requires Web API fallback |
// | window           | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span> | ✅           | ✅  | Mostly compatible         |
// | commands         | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span> | 🔄           | 🔄  | Requires Cloud backend    |
// | languages        | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span> | 🔄           | 🔄  | Requires language server  |
// | terminal         | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span> | ✅           | ✅  | xterm.js works in browser |
// | env.openExternal | ❌                                      | ✅           | ✅  | Browser-only feature      |
// | env.clipboard    | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span> | 🔄           | 🔄  | HTTPS required            |
// 
// See also: [`../standalone/`](../standalone/) for detailed standalone deployment
// strategies.

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// plans/plans/api/categories/commands.md
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # Commands API Namespace
// 
// The `commands` namespace provides command registration and execution
// functionality for extensions.
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// The commands API enables extensions to:
// 
// - **Register Commands** - Add commands to the command palette
// - **Execute Commands** - Run commands programmatically
// - **List Commands** - Query available commands
// - **Text Editor Commands** - Register commands that operate on text editors
// 
// ## Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Commands API"
//         A[Commands Namespace]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Command Registration"
//         B[registerCommand]
//         B --> B1[UI Command Registration]
//         C[registerTextEditorCommand]
//         C --> C1[Editor Command Registration]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Command Execution"
//         D[executeCommand]
//         D --> D1[Invoke Commands]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Command Query"
//         E[getCommands]
//         E --> E1[List Available Commands]
//     end
// 
//     A --> B
//     A --> C
//     A --> D
//     A --> E
// 
//     B -.->|Command Palette| F[UI Integration]
//     C -.->|Editor Context| G[Text Editor]
// ```
// 
// ## API Methods
// 
// | Method                      | Signature                                                                                                                          | Parameters                                                  | Returns                             | Cocoon                              | Grove                                 | Mountain                              | Wind                                | Sky                                 | Status                                 |
// | --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
// | `registerCommand`           | `(command: string, callback: (...args: any[]) => any, thisArg?: any) => Disposable`                                                | `command` - Command ID, `callback` - Command handler        | Disposable to unregister            | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:white">Ready</span> |
// | `registerTextEditorCommand` | `(command: string, callback: (textEditor: TextEditor, edit: TextEditorEdit, ...args: any[]) => void, thisArg?: any) => Disposable` | `command` - Command ID, `callback` - Editor command handler | Disposable to unregister            | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:white">Ready</span> |
// | `executeCommand`            | `(command: string, ...rest: any[]) => Thenable<any>`                                                                               | `command` - Command ID, `rest` - Command arguments          | Promise resolving to command result | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:white">Ready</span> |
// | `getCommands`               | `(filterInternal?: boolean) => Thenable<[string, boolean][]>`                                                                      | `filterInternal` - Exclude internal commands                | Promise resolving to command list   | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:white">Ready</span> |
// 
// ## Data Types
// 
// ### TypeScript Types
// 
// ```typescript
// // Command Handler
// type CommandHandler = (...args: any[]) => any;
// 
// // Text Editor Command Handler
// type TextEditorCommandHandler = (
// 	textEditor: TextEditor,
// 	edit: TextEditorEdit,
// 	...args: any[]
// ) => void;
// 
// // Command Information
// type Command = {
// 	title: string;
// 	command: string;
// 	tooltip?: string;
// 	category?: string;
// 	enablement?: string;
// 	when?: string;
// 	icon?: string;
// };
// 
// // Text Editor Edit
// interface TextEditorEdit {
// 	replace(location: Position | Range | Selection, value: string): void;
// 	insert(location: Position, value: string): void;
// 	delete(deleteRange: Range): void;
// 	setEndOfLine(endOfLine: EndOfLine): void;
// }
// 
// enum EndOfLine {
// 	CRLF,
// 	LF,
// }
// ```
// 
// ### Rust Types
// 
// ```rust
