// # Debug API Namespace
// 
// The `debug` namespace provides debugging capabilities including debug adapter
// protocol integration, breakpoint management, and debug console.
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// The debug API enables extensions to:
// 
// - **Start/Stop Debugging** - Control debug sessions
// - **Manage Breakpoints** - Set, clear, and modify breakpoints
// - **Debug Console** - Interact with debug sessions
// - **Debug Adapter Protocol** - Integrate debug adapters
// - **Configuration** - Manage debug launch configurations
// 
// ## Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Debug API"
//         A[Debug Namespace]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Session Management"
//         B[startDebugging]
//         C[stopDebugging]
//         D[activeDebugSession]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Breakpoints"
//         E[addBreakpoints]
//         F[removeBreakpoints]
//         G[breakpoints]
//         H[onDidChangeBreakpoints]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Debug Adapters"
//         I[registerDebugConfigurationProvider]
//         J[registerDebugAdapterDescriptorFactory]
//         K[registerDebugAdapterTrackerFactory]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Events"
//         L[onDidStartDebugSession]
//         M[onDidTerminateDebugSession]
//         N[onDidChangeActiveDebugSession]
//     end
// 
//     A --> B
//     A --> C
//     A --> E
//     A --> F
//     A --> I
//     A --> J
//     A --> K
//     A --> L
//     A --> M
//     A --> N
// ```
// 
// ## API Methods
// 
// ### Session Management
// 
// | Method               | Signature                                                                                                                               | Parameters                                                                 | Returns                        | Cocoon                                | Grove | Mountain | Wind                                  | Sky                                   | Status                                     |
// | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ----- | -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
// | `startDebugging`     | `(folder: WorkspaceFolder \| undefined, nameOrConfig: string \| DebugConfiguration, parentSession?: DebugSession) => Thenable<boolean>` | `folder` - Workspace folder, `nameOrConfig` - Launch config name or object | Promise resolving to success   | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `stopDebugging`      | `(session?: DebugSession) => Thenable<boolean>`                                                                                         | `session` - Debug session to stop                                          | Promise resolving to success   | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `activeDebugSession` | `DebugSession \| undefined`                                                                                                             | None                                                                       | Currently active debug session | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `activeDebugConsole` | `DebugConsole`                                                                                                                          | None                                                                       | Active debug console           | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// 
// ### Breakpoint Management
// 
// | Method                   | Signature                                                                                                  | Parameters                                               | Returns                        | Cocoon                                | Grove | Mountain | Wind                                  | Sky                                   | Status                                     |
// | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ----- | -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
// | `addBreakpoints`         | `(uri: URI, breakpoints: Breakpoint[]) => Thenable<void>`                                                  | `uri` - Document URI, `breakpoints` - Breakpoints to add | Promise resolving when added   | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `removeBreakpoints`      | `(uris?: URI[]) => Thenable<void>`                                                                         | `uris` - URIs to remove breakpoints from                 | Promise resolving when removed | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `breakpoints`            | `readonly Breakpoint[]`                                                                                    | None                                                     | All breakpoints                | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `onDidChangeBreakpoints` | `(listener: (e: BreakpointsChangeEvent) => any, thisArgs?: any, disposables?: Disposable[]) => Disposable` | Function to call when breakpoints change                 | Disposable to stop listening   | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// 
// ### Debug Adapter Integration
// 
// | Method                                      | Signature                                                                       | Parameters                                                    | Returns                  | Cocoon                                | Grove | Mountain | Wind                                  | Sky                                   | Status                                     |
// | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ----- | -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
// | `registerDebugConfigurationProvider`        | `(debugType: string, provider: DebugConfigurationProvider) => Disposable`       | `debugType` - Debug type, `provider` - Config provider        | Disposable to unregister | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `registerDebugAdapterDescriptorFactory`     | `(debugType: string, factory: DebugAdapterDescriptorFactory) => Disposable`     | `debugType` - Debug type, `factory` - Adapter factory         | Disposable to unregister | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `registerDebugAdapterTrackerFactory`        | `(debugType: string, factory: DebugAdapterTrackerFactory) => Disposable`        | `debugType` - Debug type, `factory` - Tracker factory         | Disposable to unregister | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `registerDebugAdapterSessionTrackerFactory` | `(debugType: string, factory: DebugAdapterSessionTrackerFactory) => Disposable` | `debugType` - Debug type, `factory` - Session tracker factory | Disposable to unregister | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// 
// ### Debug Events
// 
// | Method                                | Signature                                                                                                           | Parameters                                       | Returns                      | Cocoon                                | Grove | Mountain | Wind                                  | Sky                                   | Status                                     |
// | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----- | -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
// | `onDidStartDebugSession`              | `(listener: (session: DebugSession) => any, thisArgs?: any, disposables?: Disposable[]) => Disposable`              | Function to call when session starts             | Disposable to stop listening | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `onDidTerminateDebugSession`          | `(listener: (session: DebugSession) => any, thisArgs?: any, disposables?: Disposable[]) => Disposable`              | Function to call when session terminates         | Disposable to stop listening | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `onDidChangeActiveDebugSession`       | `(listener: (session: DebugSession \| undefined) => any, thisArgs?: any, disposables?: Disposable[]) => Disposable` | Function to call when active session changes     | Disposable to stop listening | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `onDidReceiveDebugSessionCustomEvent` | `(listener: (e: DebugSessionCustomEvent) => any, thisArgs?: any, disposables?: Disposable[]) => Disposable`         | Function to call on custom events                | Disposable to stop listening | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `onDidChangeDebugConsoleVisibility`   | `(listener: (visible: boolean) => any, thisArgs?: any, disposables?: Disposable[]) => Disposable`                   | Function to call when console visibility changes | Disposable to stop listening | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌    | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// 
// ## Implementation Status
// 
// The Debug API is currently in the **planned phase** for most variants.
// 
// ### Current Progress
// 
// | Variant  | Completion                               | Focus Area                                  |
// | -------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
// | Cocoon   | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Debug adapter protocol integration          |
// | Grove    | ❌ Not Planned                           | Native debugging (use external debuggers)   |
// | Mountain | ❌ Not Applicable                        | Backend debugging (separate infrastructure) |
// | Wind     | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Lightweight debugging support               |
// | Sky      | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Web-based debugging via DAP over WebSocket  |
// 
// ### Implementation Priorities
// 
// **Phase 3.1 - Core Debugging (High Priority)**
// 
// 1. Start/stop debugging
// 2. Breakpoint management
// 3. Debug configuration providers
// 4. Debug console integration
// 
// **Phase 3.2 - Debug Adapter Integration (Medium Priority)**
// 
// 1. Debug adapter descriptor factories
// 2. Custom event handling
// 3. Session tracking
// 
// **Phase 3.3 - Advanced Debugging (Low Priority)**
// 
// 1. Debug adapter trackers
// 2. Multi-session debugging
// 3. Debug visualization
// 
// ### Cross-Variant Considerations
// 
// 1. **Debug Adapter Protocol (DAP)**
//     - Standardize DAP implementation across variants
//     - Support for common debug adapters (Node.js, Python, etc.)
//     - WebSocket-based DAP for web variants
// 
// 2. **Debug Configuration**
//     - Share debug configuration formats
//     - Support for `launch.json` configuration
//     - Configuration validation and resolution
// 
// 3. **UI Integration**
//     - Consistent debug UI across variants
//     - Variable inspection views
//     - Call stack visualization
//     - Watch expressions
// 
// ## Debug Adapter Protocol (DAP)
// 
// The Debug API is built on top of the Debug Adapter Protocol, which standardizes
// communication between the editor and debug adapters.
// 
// ### Key DAP Concepts
// 
// - **Debug Adapter** - Implements debug logic for a specific language/runtime
// - **Debug Session** - A single debugging session
// - **Breakpoints** - Points where execution pauses
// - **Stack Traces** - Call stack information
// - **Variables** - Runtime variable values
// - **Evaluation** - Evaluate expressions in debugged context
// 
// ### Supported DAP Features
// 
// | Feature               | Description                         | Priority |
// | --------------------- | ----------------------------------- | -------- |
// | Launch/Attach         | Start or attach to debug target     | High     |
// | Breakpoints           | Set, toggle, and manage breakpoints | High     |
// | Step Control          | Step over, into, out                | High     |
// | Variables             | Inspect variables and their values  | High     |
// | Stack Trace           | View call stack                     | Medium   |
// | Watch Expressions     | Evaluate and watch expressions      | Medium   |
// | Exception Breakpoints | Break on exceptions                 | Low      |
// | Configuration         | Debug configuration management      | High     |
// 
// ## Related Documentation
// 
// - [Component: Cocoon](../../Architecture/components/cocoon.md) - VS Code
//   extension host details
// - [Component: Wind](../../Architecture/components/wind.md) - Embedded runtime
//   details
// - [Component: Sky](../../Architecture/components/sky.md) - Web runtime details
// - [Debug Adapter Protocol](https://microsoft.github.io/debug-adapter-protocol/) -
//   DAP specification
// 
// ---
// 
// **Last Updated:** 2026-02-08  
// **Status:** <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned (Phase 3)</span>  
// **Maintained By:** CodeEditorLand Architecture Team

