// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # Languages API Namespace
// 
// The `languages` namespace provides language feature providers and
// language-related functionality.
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// The languages API enables extensions to provide:
// 
// - **Code Completion** - IntelliSense-like code suggestions
// - **Hover Information** - Tooltips with documentation
// - **Definitions** - Go to definition functionality
// - **References** - Find all references
// - **Diagnostics** - Error and warning markers
// - **Code Actions** - Quick fixes and refactorings
// - **Formatting** - Code formatting providers
// - **And many more language features**
// 
// ## Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Languages API"
//         A[VSCode Languages API]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Language Providers"
//         B[Completion Provider]
//         C[Hover Provider]
//         D[Definition Provider]
//         E[Reference Provider]
//         F[Code Action Provider]
//         G[Formatting Provider]
//         H[Diagnostic Collection]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Registration"
//         I[registerCompletionItemProvider]
//         J[registerHoverProvider]
//         K[registerDefinitionProvider]
//         L[registerReferenceProvider]
//         M[registerCodeActionsProvider]
//         N[registerFormattingProvider]
//         O[createDiagnosticCollection]
//     end
// 
//     A --> B
//     A --> C
//     A --> D
//     A --> E
//     A --> F
//     A --> G
//     A --> H
// 
//     I --> B
//     J --> C
//     K --> D
//     L --> E
//     M --> F
//     N --> G
//     O --> H
// ```
// 
// ## API Methods
// 
// ### Core Language Providers
// 
// | Method                           | Signature                                                                                                      | Parameters                                                       | Returns    | Cocoon                                | Grove                                 | Mountain | Wind                                  | Sky                                   | Status                                     |
// | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
// | `registerCompletionItemProvider` | `(selector: DocumentSelector, provider: CompletionItemProvider, ...triggerCharacters: string[]) => Disposable` | `selector` - Document selector, `provider` - Completion provider | Disposable | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `registerHoverProvider`          | `(selector: DocumentSelector, provider: HoverProvider) => Disposable`                                          | `selector` - Document selector, `provider` - Hover provider      | Disposable | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `registerDefinitionProvider`     | `(selector: DocumentSelector, provider: DefinitionProvider) => Disposable`                                     | `selector` - Document selector, `provider` - Definition provider | Disposable | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
