// | `registerSignatureHelpProvider`          | `(selector: DocumentSelector, provider: SignatureHelpProvider, triggerCharacters: string[]) => Disposable`           | `selector` - Document selector, `provider` - Signature help provider  | Disposable | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `registerDocumentSemanticTokensProvider` | `(selector: DocumentSelector, provider: DocumentSemanticTokensProvider, legend: SemanticTokensLegend) => Disposable` | `selector` - Document selector, `provider` - Semantic tokens provider | Disposable | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// 
// ### Utility Methods
// 
// | Method         | Signature                                                        | Parameters                                                     | Returns                           | Cocoon                                | Grove                                 | Mountain | Wind                                  | Sky                                   | Status                                     |
// | -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
// | `match`        | `(selector: DocumentSelector, document: TextDocument) => number` | `selector` - Document selector, `document` - Document to match | Match score (0 = no match)        | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `getLanguages` | `() => Thenable<string[]>`                                       | None                                                           | Promise resolving to language IDs | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | ❌       | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// 
// ## Implementation Status
// 
// The Languages API is currently in the **planned phase** for most variants.
// 
// ### Current Progress
// 
// | Variant  | Completion                               | Focus Area                                        |
// | -------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
// | Cocoon   | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Platform for language server integration          |
// | Grove    | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Rust-based language server support                |
// | Mountain | ❌ Not Applicable                        | Backend analysis services (separate)              |
// | Wind     | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Lightweight language features                     |
// | Sky      | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Web-based language support via LSP over WebSocket |
// 
// ### Implementation Priorities
// 
// **Phase 2.1 - Core Features (High Priority)**
// 
// 1. Completion provider
// 2. Hover provider
// 3. Diagnostic collection
// 4. Basic code actions
// 
// **Phase 2.2 - Navigation & Editing (Medium Priority)**
// 
// 1. Definition provider
// 2. Reference provider
// 3. Formatting provider
// 4. Document symbols
// 
// **Phase 2.3 - Advanced Features (Low Priority)**
// 
// 1. Advanced code actions
// 2. Semantic tokens
// 3. Rename provider
// 4. Signature help
// 
// ### Cross-Variant Considerations
// 
// 1. **Language Server Protocol (LSP)**
//     - LSP integration should be consistent across variants
//     - Allow extensions to supply LSP servers
//     - Standardize LSP-to-API mapping
// 
// 2. **Performance**
//     - Language features must be performant
//     - Implement caching strategies
//     - Support incremental updates
// 
// 3. **Resource Limits**
//     - Define limits for providers
//     - Implement timeouts
//     - Handle cancellation gracefully
// 
// ## Related Documentation
// 
// - [Component: Cocoon](../../Architecture/components/cocoon.md) - VS Code
//   extension host details
// - [Component: Grove](../../Architecture/components/grove.md) - Rust application
//   details
// - [Component: Wind](../../Architecture/components/wind.md) - Embedded runtime
//   details
// - [Component: Sky](../../Architecture/components/sky.md) - Web runtime details
// - [Workflow: Language Features](../../GitHub/Workflow/) - Language feature
//   workflows
// 
// ---
// 
// **Last Updated:** 2026-02-08  
// **Status:** <span style="color:#64b6ff">Implementation in Progress
// (Phase 2)</span>  
// **Maintained By:** CodeEditorLand Architecture Team

