// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// plans/plans/api/categories/scm.md
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # SCM API Namespace
// 
// The `scm` namespace provides source control management functionality.
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// The SCM API enables extensions to:
// 
// - **Source Control Providers** - Create custom source control integrations
// - **Resource Groups** - Organize changed files (modified, staged, untracked)
// - **File Operations** - Stage, unstage, discard, and commit changes
// - **Input Boxes** - Provide commit message input
// - **History** - Access commit history and changes
// 
// ## Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "SCM API"
//         A[SCM Namespace]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Source Control"
//         B[SourceControl]
//         B --> B1[Resource Groups]
//         B --> B2[File Operations]
//         B --> B3[Commands]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Registration"
//         C[createSourceControl]
//         D[onDidChangeActiveSourceControl]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "UI Elements"
//         E[Resource Groups]
//         F[Input Box]
//         G[Badges]
//     end
// 
//     A --> B
//     A --> C
//     A --> D
// 
//     B --> E
//     B --> F
//     B --> G
// ```
// 
// ## API Methods
// 
// | Method                           | Signature                                                                                                      | Parameters                                                               | Returns                         | Cocoon                                | Grove                                 | Mountain                              | Wind                                  | Sky                                   | Status                                     |
// | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
// | `createSourceControl`            | `(id: string, label: string, rootUri?: URI) => SourceControl`                                                  | `id` - Provider ID, `label` - Display label, `rootUri` - Repository root | Source control instance         | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `onDidChangeActiveSourceControl` | `(listener: (e: SourceControl \| undefined) => any, thisArgs?: any, disposables?: Disposable[]) => Disposable` | Function to call when active source control changes                      | Disposable to stop listening    | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | `activeSourceControl`            | `SourceControl \| undefined`                                                                                   | None                                                                     | Currently active source control | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// 
// ## Implementation Status
// 
// The SCM API is currently in the **planned phase** for all variants.
// 
// ### Current Progress
// 
// | Variant  | Completion                               | Focus Area                           |
// | -------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
// | Cocoon   | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Git integration via built-in support |
// | Grove    | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Rust-based Git integration           |
// | Mountain | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Backend SCM services                 |
// | Wind     | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Lightweight SCM UI                   |
// | Sky      | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄 0%</span> | Web-based SCM interface              |
// 
// ### Implementation Priorities
// 
// **Phase 3.1 - Core SCM (High Priority)**
// 
// 1. Source control provider creation
// 2. Resource group management
// 3. File status tracking
// 4. Commit message input
// 
// **Phase 3.2 - SCM Operations (Medium Priority)**
// 
// 1. Stage/unstage files
// 2. Discard changes
// 3. Commit operations
// 4. Diff viewing
// 
// **Phase 3.3 - Advanced SCM (Low Priority)**
// 
// 1. Commit history
// 2. Branch management
// 3. Merge operations
// 4. Conflict resolution
// 
// ### Cross-Variant Considerations
// 
// 1. **Git Integration**
//     - Standard Git operations across variants
//     - Support for common Git workflows
//     - Branch and tag management
// 
// 2. **Backend Services**
//     - Mountain backend for Git operations
//     - Remote repository access
//     - Authentication and credentials
// 
// 3. **UI Consistency**
//     - Consistent SCM UI across variants
//     - File status indicators
//     - Commit history views
// 
// ## Related Documentation
// 
// - [Component: Cocoon](../../Architecture/components/cocoon.md) - VS Code
//   extension host details
// - [Component: Grove](../../Architecture/components/grove.md) - Rust application
//   details
// - [Component: Mountain](../../Architecture/components/mountain.md) - Backend
//   service details
// - [Workflow: Source Control](<../../GitHub/Workflow/Source%20Control%20Management%20(SCM).md>) -
//   SCM workflow
// 
// ---
// 
// **Last Updated:** 2026-02-08  
// **Status:** <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned (Phase 3)</span>  
// **Maintained By:** CodeEditorLand Architecture Team

