// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # Terminal API Namespace
// 
// The `terminal` namespace provides terminal integration and process management
// functionality.
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// The terminal API enables extensions to:
// 
// - **Create Terminals** - Launch integrated terminal instances
// - **Send Input** - Send commands and text to terminals
// - **Process Management** - Get process IDs and exit status
// - **Terminal Events** - Listen to terminal creation, writing, and closing
// - **Extension Terminals** - Create custom pseudo-terminal implementations
// 
// ## Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Terminal API"
//         A[Terminal Namespace]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Terminal Creation"
//         B[createTerminal]
//         B --> B1[Shell Terminal]
//         B --> B2[Extension Terminal]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Terminal Operations"
//         C[sendText]
//         C --> C1[Commands]
//         C --> C2[Input]
//         D[show]
//         D --> D1[Focus Terminal]
//         E[hide]
//         E --> E1[Hide Terminal]
//         F[dispose]
//         F --> F1[Close Terminal]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Terminal Information"
//         G[name]
//         G --> G1[Terminal Name]
//         H[processId]
//         H --> H1[Process ID]
//         I[exitStatus]
//         I --> I1[Exit Code]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Terminal Events"
//         J[onDidWrite]
//         J --> J1[Output Capture]
//         K[onDidChangeDimensions]
//         K --> K1[Resize Events]
//         L[onDidClose]
//         L --> L1[Terminal Closed]
//     end
// 
//     A --> B
//     A --> C
//     A --> D
//     A --> E
//     A --> F
//     A --> G
//     A --> H
//     A --> I
//     A --> J
//     A --> K
//     A --> L
// ```
// 
// ## API Methods
// 
// ### Terminal Creation
// 
// | Method           | Signature                                                                         | Parameters                                                                            | Returns           | Cocoon                              | Grove                                 | Mountain                              | Wind                                | Sky                                   | Status                                 |
// | ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
// | `createTerminal` | `(name?: string, shellPath?: string, shellArgs?: string[] \| string) => Terminal` | `name` - Terminal name, `shellPath` - Shell executable, `shellArgs` - Shell arguments | Terminal instance | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">Ready</span> |
// | `createTerminal` | `(options: TerminalOptions) => Terminal`                                          | `options` - Terminal options                                                          | Terminal instance | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">Ready</span> |
// | `createTerminal` | `(options: ExtensionTerminalOptions) => Terminal`                                 | `options` - Extension terminal options                                                | Terminal instance | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">Ready</span> |
// 
// ### Terminal Information
// 
// | Property          | Type                                          | Returns          | Cocoon                              | Grove                                 | Mountain                              | Wind                                | Sky                                   | Status                                 |
// | ----------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
// | `name`            | `string`                                      | Terminal name    | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">Ready</span> |
// | `processId`       | `Thenable<number \| undefined>`               | Process ID       | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">Ready</span> |
// | `creationOptions` | `TerminalOptions \| ExtensionTerminalOptions` | Creation options | <span style="color:white">✅</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span  |

