// # Workspace API Namespace (`workspace.*`)
// 
// **Color Coding:**
// 
// - <span style="color:white">White text</span> = Ready ✅ - Implemented and
//   working
// - <span style="color:#64b6ff">Blue text</span> = 🔄 Planned - Pending
//   implementation or future work
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// The `workspace` namespace provides file system access, configuration management,
// and workspace folder management.
// 
// ## API Methods
// 
// | Method                                  | Signature                                                     | Cocoon                                    | Grove | Mountain | Wind                                      | Sky | Status                                                                              | Notes |
// | --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----- | -------- | ----------------------------------------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----- |
// | `workspace.workspaceFolders`            | `readonly workspaceFolders: WorkspaceFolder[]`                | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | ❌  | <span style="color:white">Implemented in Workspace.ts, returns static data</span>   |
// | `workspace.openTextDocument()`          | `openTextDocument(uri: Uri, options?): Promise<TextDocument>` | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | ❌  | <span style="color:white">Implemented in Workspace.ts, returns mock document</span> |
// | `workspace.onDidChangeWorkspaceFolders` | `Event<WorkspaceFoldersChangeEvent>`                          | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ✅                                        | ❌  | <span style="color:white">Emitter exists but may not emit events</span>             |
// | `workspace.onDidChangeConfiguration`    | `Event<void>`                                                 | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ✅                                        | ❌  | <span style="color:white">Event stream exists in Configuration</span>               |
// | `workspace.getConfiguration()`          | `getConfiguration(section?: string): WorkspaceConfiguration`  | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | ❌  | <span style="color:white">Delegates to ConfigurationService</span>                  |
// | `workspace.onDidSaveTextDocument`       | `Event<TextDocumentSaveEvent>`                                | 🔄                                        | 🔄    | 🔄       | 🔄                                        | ❌  | <span style="color:#64bff">All Planned</span>                                       |
// | `workspace.onWillSaveTextDocument`      | `Event<WillSaveTextDocumentEvent>`                            | 🔄                                        | 🔄    | 🔄       | 🔄                                        | ❌  | <span style="color:#64bff">All Planned</span>                                       |
// 
// ## File System API (`workspace.fs.*`)
// 
// | Method                                    | Signature                                                 | Cocoon                                    | Grove | Mountain | Wind | Sky                                           | Status                                                                                 |
// | ----------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----- | -------- | ---- | --------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
// | `workspace.fs.stat()`                     | `stat(uri: Uri): Promise<FileStat>`                       | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ❌   | ❌                                            | <span style="color:white">Implemented in FileSystemService.ts, gRPC to Mountain</span> |
// | `workspace.fs.readFile()`                 | `readFile(uri: Uri): Promise<Uint8Array>`                 | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ❌   | ❌                                            | <span style="color:white">Implemented in FileSystemService.ts</span>                   |
// | `workspace.fs.writeFile()`                | `writeFile(uri: Uri, content: Uint8Array): Promise<void>` | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ❌   | ❌                                            | <span style="color:white">Implemented in FileSystemService.ts</span>                   |
// | `workspace.fs.readDirectory()`            | `readDirectory(uri: Uri): Promise<[string][]>`            | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ❌   | ❌                                            | <span style="color:white">Implemented in FileSystemService.ts</span>                   |
// | `workspace.fs.createDirectory()`          | `createDirectory(uri: Uri): Promise<void>`                | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ❌   | ❌                                            | <span style="color:white">Implemented in FileSystemService.ts</span>                   |
// | `workspace.fs.delete()`                   | `delete(uri: Uri): Promise<void>`                         | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ❌   | ❌                                            | <span style="color:white">Implemented in FileSystemService.ts</span>                   |
// | `workspace.fs.rename()`                   | `rename(oldUri: Uri, newUri: Uri): Promise<void>`         | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ❌   | ❌                                            | <span style="color:white">Implemented in FileSystemService.ts</span>                   |
// | `workspace.fs.isWritableFileSystem`       | `get isWritableFileSystem(): boolean`                     | 🔄                                        | 🔄    | 🔄       | 🔄   | 🔄                                            | <span style="color:#64bff">All Planned</span>                                          |
// | `workspace.fs.resolve(path: string): Uri` | 🔄                                                        | 🔄                                        | 🔄    | 🔄       | 🔄   | <span style="color:#64bff">All Planned</span> |
// 
// ## Configuration API
// 
// | Method                  | Signature                                                  | Cocoon                                    | Grove | Mountain | Wind | Sky | Status                                                                                |
// | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----- | -------- | ---- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
// | `getConfiguration()`    | `getConfiguration(scope?: string): WorkspaceConfiguration` | <span style="color:white">Ready ✅</span> | 🔄    | ❌       | ✅   | ∂   | <span style="color:white">Working in ConfigurationService, syncs with Mountain</span> |
// | `updateConfiguration()` | `updateConfiguration(value: any): Thenable<void>`          | 🔄                                        | 🔄    | ❌       | ∂    | 🔄  | <span style="color:#64bff">Partially Planned - stub exists</span>                     |
// 
// ## Data Types
// 
// | Type                     | Description                             | Compatibility                           |
// | ------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
// | `Uri`                    | Uniform Resource Identifier             | All variants                            |
// | `WorkspaceFolder`        | workspace folder descriptor             | Available in all variants               |
// | `WorkspaceConfiguration` | Configuration accessor object           | Available in all variants               |
// | `FileStat`               | File metadata (size, permissions, etc.) | Basic fields available in all variants  |
// | `TextDocument`           | Text document representation            | Mock/baseline in current implementation |
// | `FileChangeEvent`        | File change event information           | Basic event structure                   |
// 
// ## Events
// 
// | Event                         | Trigger                   | Data                          | Cocoon | Grove | Mountain | Wind | Sky |
// | ----------------------------- | ------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ------ | ----- | -------- | ---- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |
// | `onDidChangeWorkspaceFolders` | Workspace folders changed | `WorkspaceFoldersChangeEvent` | ✅     | 🔄    | ✅       | 🔄   | ✅  | <span style="color:white">Emitter exists, may not fire events</span>   |
// | `onDidChangeConfiguration`    | Configuration changed     | `void`                        | ✅     | 🔄    | ✅       | 🔄   | ✅  | <span style="color:white">Events stream exists in Configuration</span> |
// | `onDidSaveTextDocument`       | Document saved            | `TextDocumentSaveEvent`       | 🔄     | 🔄    | 🔄       | 🔄   | ❌  | <span style="color:#64bff">All Planned</span>                          |
// | `onWillSaveTextDocument`      | Document about to save    | `WillSaveTextDocumentEvent`   | 🔄     | 🔄    | 🔄       | 🔄   | ❌  | <span style="color:#64bff">All Planned</span>                          |
// 
// ## Implementation Notes
// 
// ### File System API
// 
// - **Cocoon**: Fully implemented via
//   [`FileSystemService.ts`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/Element/Cocoon/Source/Services/FileSystemService.ts)
//   with gRPC bridge to Mountain
// - **Standalone**: Would require Web File System Access API or IndexedDB storage
// - **Grove**: Would need WASM host functions for file operations
// 
// ### Configuration API
// 
// - **Cocoon**:
//   [`ConfigurationService`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/Element/Cocoon/Source/Services/Configuration.ts)
//   with local caching and sync to Mountain
// - **Standalone**: Would use localStorage or IndexedDB for persistence
// - **Mountain**: Direct access to native file system
// 
// ### Workspace Management
// 
// - **Cocoon**:
//   [`Workspace.ts`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/Element/Cocoon/Source/Services/Workspace.ts)
//   provides workspace folder management
// - **Mountain**:
//   [`WorkspaceFileService`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/Element/Mountain/Source/Workspace/WorkspaceFileService.ts)
//   implements workspace file handling
// - **Wind**:
//   [`Workspace.ts`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/Element/Wind/Source/Effect/Workspace.ts)
//   handles workspace state in UI layer
// 
// ## Spine Integration Impact
// 
// | Aspect                                 | Cocoon                                     | Grove | Mountain                                   | Notes                                                                                |
// | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ----- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
// | `workspace.fs.*` calls route via Spine | <span style="color:white">✅ Active</span> | 🔄    | <span style="color:white">✅ Active</span> | Implemented but stub in some Cocoon services                                         |
// | Configuration sync via Spine           | <span style="color:white">✅ Active</span> | 🔄    | <span style="color:white">✅ Active</span> | Mountain receives `config.update` and `config.reload`                                |
// | Workspace folder management via Spine  | 🔄                                         | ❌    | <span style="color:white">✅ Active</span> | Mountain provides workspace folders via `CocoonServiceServer.ProcessMountainRequest` |
// 
// ## Extension Compatibility
// 
// | Extension | workspace.fs | workspace.openTextDocument | workspace configuration | Status                                                   |
// | --------- | ------------ | -------------------------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
// | Python    | ✅           | ✅                         | ✅                      | <span style="color:white">Fully Compatible</span>        |
// | Prettier  | ✅           | ❌                         | ✅                      | <span style="color:#64bff">Needs openTextDocument</span> |
// | ESLint    | ✅           | ❌                         | ✅                      | <span style="color:#64bff">Needs openTextDocument</span> |
// | GitLens   | ✅           | ✅                         | ✅                      | <span style="color:white">Fully Compatible</span>        |
// 
// ## Standalone Mode Compatibility
// 
// | API                            | Mountain Required                       | Browser-Only | PWA | Notes                                        |
// | ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ------------ | --- | -------------------------------------------- |
// | `workspace.fs.*`               | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span> | 🔄           | 🔄  | Requires File System Access API or IndexedDB |
// | `workspace.getConfiguration()` | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span> | 🔄           | 🔄  | Needs local storage + event sync             |
// | `workspace.openTextDocument()` | <span style="color:white">Yes ✅</span> | 🔄           | 🔄  | Needs Monaco Editor + IndexedDB              |
// 
// ---
// 
// See also:
// [`workspace.md`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/workspace.md)
// for full method listing,
// [`cocoon-grove-api-compat.md`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/compatibility/cocoon-grove-api-compat.md)
// for Cocoon-Grove compatibility.

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// plans/plans/api/compatibility/cocoon-grove-api-compat.md
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # Cocoon vs Grove API Compatibility
// 
// Comprehensive guide for migrating TypeScript-based Cocoon extensions to
// Rust-based Grove applications while maintaining compatibility.
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// This document provides:
// 
// - **Type Mapping** - Complete TypeScript to Rust type correspondence
// - **API Method Mapping** - Method signature translations
// - **Migration Guide** - Step-by-step migration instructions
// - **Code Examples** - Side-by-side comparisons
// - **Best Practices** - Patterns for cross-variant compatibility
// 
// ## Architecture Comparison
// 
// ### Cocoon (TypeScript)
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Cocoon TypeScript"
//         A[VS Code Extension Host]
//         B[TypeScript Extensions]
//         C[Node.js Runtime]
//         A --> B
//         B --> C
//     end
// ```
// 
// ### Grove (Rust)
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Grove Rust"
//         A[Native Application]
//         B[Rust Extensions]
//         C[Tokio Runtime]
//         A --> B
//         B --> C
//     end
// ```
// 
// ## Type Mapping
// 
// ### Primitive Types
// 
// | TypeScript | Rust             | Notes                                       |
// | ---------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
// | `string`   | `String`, `&str` | Use `Cow<'_, str>` for flexible ownership   |
// | `number`   | `f64`            | JavaScript numbers are always 64-bit floats |
// | `boolean`  | `bool`           | Direct mapping                              |

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// plans/plans/api/compatibility/mountain-backend-bridging.md
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # Mountain Backend Bridging
// 
// Backend service bridging patterns and Spine integration for CodeEditorLand variants.
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// This document describes:
// 
// - **Backend Services** - Mountain backend service architecture
// - **Spine Protocol** - Communication protocol between variants and backend
// - **Bridging Patterns** - Patterns for accessing backend services
// - **Service Availability** - Gradient of service availability across variants
// - **Integration Examples** - Practical integration patterns
// 
// ## Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Frontend Variants"
//         A[Cocoon]
//         B[Grove]
//         C[Wind]
//         D[Sky]
//     end
//     
//     subgraph "Spine Protocol"
//         E[Spine Client]
//         F[Spine Server]
//         E ↔ F
//     end
//     
//     subgraph "Mountain Backend"
//         G[File System Service]
//         H[Configuration Service]
//         I[Command Service]
//         J[Terminal Service]
//         K[Environment Service]
//     end
//     
//     A → E
//     B → E
//     C → E
//     D → E
//     
//     F → G
//     F → H
//     F → I
//     F → J
//     F → K
// ```
// 
// ## Service Architecture
// 
// ### Mountain Backend Services
// 
// | Service | Description | Access Pattern | Availability |
// |---------|-------------|----------------|--------------|
// | FileSystem | File read/write operations | Spine RPC | <span style="color:white">All variants</span> |
// | Configuration | Workspace settings | Spine RPC | <span style="color:white">All variants</span> |
// | Command | Command execution | Spine RPC | <span style="color:white">All variants</span> |
// | Terminal | Terminal management | Spine RPC | <span style="color:white">Cocoon, Grove, Wind</span> |
// | Environment | System information | Spine RPC | <span style="color:white">All variants</span> |
// | LanguageServer | Language features | Spine RPC + WebSocket | <span style="color:white">Cocoon, Grove</span> |
// | Debug | Debug adapter protocol | Spine RPC + WebSocket | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Cocoon, Wind</span> |
// | SCM | Source control | Spine RPC | <span style="color:#64b6ff">All variants</span> |
// 
// ## Spine Protocol
// 
// ### Request/Response Pattern
// 
// **Request Format:**
// 
// ```typescript
// interface SpineRequest {
//     id: string;
//     method: string;
//     params: any;
//     timestamp: number;
// }
// ```
// 
// ```rust
// #[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]
// pub struct SpineRequest {
//     pub id: String,
//     pub method: String,
//     pub params: serde_json::Value,
//     pub timestamp: u64,
// }
// ```
// 
// **Response Format:**
// 
// ```typescript
// interface SpineResponse {
//     id: string;
//     result?: any;
//     error?: SpineError;
//     timestamp: number;
// }
// ```
// 
// ```rust
// #[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]
// pub struct SpineResponse {
//     pub id: String,
//     pub result: Option<serde_json::Value>,
//     pub error: Option<SpineError>,
//     pub timestamp: u64,
// }
// ```
// 
// ### Transport Protocols
// 
// | Protocol | Use Case | Variants | Latency | Reliability |
// |----------|----------|----------|---------|-------------|
// | WebSocket | Real-time communication | All types | Low | High |
// | HTTP/2 | Request/response | All types | Medium | High |
// | gRPC | High-performance RPC | Grove, Mountain | Very Low | High |
// 
// ## Bridging Patterns
// 
// ### Pattern 1: Direct Access + Fallback
// 
// ```typescript
// class BackendAwareWorkspace implements WorkspaceAPI {
//     private spine: SpineClient;
//     private local: WorkspaceAPI;
//     
//     constructor(spine: SpineClient, local: WorkspaceAPI) {
