// # Unified API Surface Documentation
// 
// **Color Coding Legend:**
// 
// - <span style="color:white">White text</span> = Ready ✅ - Implemented and
//   working
// - <span style="color:#64b6ff">Blue text</span> = 🔄 Planned - Pending
//   implementation or future work
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// This documents the unified VS Code API surface that works across all
// CodeEditorLand variants:
// 
// - **Cocoon** - Node.js Extension Host
// - **Grove** - Rust/WASM Extension Host
// - **Mountain** - Native Backend (Tauri)
// - **Air** - Background Daemon
// - **Wind** - UI Service Layer (Effect-TS)
// - **Sky** - UI Components (Astro)
// 
// ## API Namespace Catalog
// 
// | Namespace                                                                                              | Description                                             | Pages          |
// | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- | -------------- |
// | [`workspace`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/workspace.md)   | Workspace operations, file system access, configuration | `workspace.*`  |
// | [`window`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/window.md)         | UI dialogs, messages, terminal, QuickPick, status bar   | `window.*`     |
// | [`commands`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/commands.md)     | Command registration and execution                      | `commands.*`   |
// | [`languages`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/languages.md)   | Language providers, language features, diagnostics      | `languages.*`  |
// | [`debug`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/debug.md)           | Debug adapter protocol, breakpoints, debugging          | `debug.*`      |
// | [`scm`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/scm.md)               | Source control management, Git operations               | `scm.*`        |
// | [`terminal`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/terminal.md)     | Terminal creation, terminal management                  | `terminal.*`   |
// | [`env`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/env.md)               | Environment info, clipboard, shell access               | `env.*`        |
// | [`extensions`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/extensions.md) | Extension discovery, activation, lifecycle              | `extensions.*` |
// 
// ## Variant Support Matrix
// 
// | API Namespace | Cocoon                                    | Grove | Mountain | Wind | Sky | Status                                                 |
// | ------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----- | -------- | ---- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
