// | [`env`](https://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Land/tree/Current/plans/api/categories/env.md)             | Environment, app info, clipboard              | <span style="color:white">✅</span>   | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:#64b6ff">🔄</span> | <span style="color:white">✅</span>   | <span style="color:white">✅</span>   | <span style="color:white">Ready</span>     |
// 
// ## Cross-Variant Compatibility Matrix
// 
// ### API Method Compatibility
// 
// | Variant  | Type Safety   | Async Support    | Event Emitters  | Disposable Pattern | Status                                     |
// | -------- | ------------- | ---------------- | --------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |
// | Cocoon   | ✅ TypeScript | ✅ Promise/async | ✅ EventEmitter | ✅ Disposable      | <span style="color:white">Ready</span>     |
// | Grove    | ✅ Rust       | ✅ async/await   | ✅ Channels     | ✅ Drop trait      | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | Mountain | ✅ Rust       | ✅ async/await   | 🔄 Limited      | ✅ Drop trait      | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// | Wind     | ✅ TypeScript | ✅ Promise/async | ✅ EventEmitter | ✅ Disposable      | <span style="color:white">Ready</span>     |
// | Sky      | ✅ TypeScript | ✅ Promise/async | ✅ EventEmitter | ✅ Disposable      | <span style="color:white">Ready</span>     |
// 
// ### Extension API Coverage
// 
// | API Category       | VS Code v1.x | VS Code v2.x | Support Level                              |
// | ------------------ | ------------ | ------------ | ------------------------------------------ |
// | Workspace FS       | ✅           | ✅           | <span style="color:white">Full</span>      |
// | Configuration      | ✅           | ✅           | <span style="color:white">Full</span>      |
// | Workspace Folders  | ✅           | ✅           | <span style="color:white">Full</span>      |
// | Text Documents     | ✅           | ✅           | <span style="color:white">Full</span>      |
// | UI / Messages      | ✅           | ✅           | <span style="color:white">Full</span>      |
// | Dialogs            | ✅           | ✅           | <span style="color:white">Full</span>      |
// | Commands           | ✅           | ✅           | <span style="color:white">Full</span>      |
// | Terminals          | ✅           | ✅           | <span style="color:white">Partial</span>   |
// | Language Providers | 🔄           | 🔄           | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Partial</span> |
// | Debug              | 🔄           | ❌           | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Limited</span> |
// | SCM                | 🔄           | 🔄           | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Partial</span> |
// | Tasks              | ❌           | ❌           | <span style="color:#64b6ff">Planned</span> |
// 
// ## Core Data Types
// 
// ### TypeScript
// 
// ```typescript
// // URI handling
// interface URI {
// 	scheme: string;
// 	authority: string;
// 	path: string;
// 	query: string;
// 	fragment: string;
// 	toString(): string;
// 	with(changes: Partial<URI>): URI;
// 	fsPath: string;
// }
// 
// // Disposable pattern
// interface Disposable {
// 	dispose(): void;
// }
// 
// // Position in text document
// interface Position {
// 	line: number;
// 	character: number;
// }
// 
// // Range in text document
// interface Range {
// 	start: Position;
// 	end: Position;
// }
// 
// // Text document
// interface TextDocument {
// 	uri: URI;
// 	fileName: string;
// 	isUntitled: boolean;
// 	languageId: string;
// 	version: number;
// 	isDirty: boolean;
// 	isClosed: boolean;
// 	save(): Thenable<boolean>;
// 	getText(range?: Range): string;
// 	getWordRangeAtPosition(position: Position): Range | undefined;
// }
// 
// // Event types
// type Event<T> = (
// 	listener: (e: T) => any,
// 	thisArgs?: any,
// 	disposables?: Disposable[],
// ) => Disposable;
// ```
// 
// ### Rust
// 
// ```rust
// // URI handling
// #[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Hash)]
// pub struct Uri {
//     pub scheme: String,
//     pub authority: String,
//     pub path: String,
//     pub query: String,
//     pub fragment: String,
// }
// 
// impl Uri {
//     pub fn to_string(&self) -> String;
//     pub fn with_path(&self, path: String) -> Self;
//     pub fn fs_path(&self) -> PathBuf;
// }
// 
// // Disposable pattern
// pub trait Disposable {
//     fn dispose(self);
// }
// 
// // Position in text document
// #[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq, Hash)]
// pub struct Position {
//     pub line: u32,
//     pub character: u32,
// }
// 
// // Range in text document
// #[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq)]
// pub struct Range {
//     pub start: Position,
//     pub end: Position,
// }
// 
// // Text document
// pub trait TextDocument {
//     fn uri(&self) -> &Uri;
//     fn file_name(&self) -> &Path;
//     fn is_untitled(&self) -> bool;
//     fn language_id(&self) -> &str;
//     fn version(&self) -> i32;
//     fn is_dirty(&self) -> bool;
//     fn is_closed(&self) -> bool;
//     fn save(&self) -> impl Future<Output = Result<bool>>;
//     fn get_text(&self, range: Option<Range>) -> String;
// }
// 
// // Event types (using channels)
// pub type Event<T> = mpsc::Sender<T>;
// ```
// 
// ## Type Mapping: TypeScript ↔ Rust
// 
// | TypeScript Type | Rust Type                         | Notes                                     |
// | --------------- | --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
// | `string`        | `String`, `&str`                  | Use `Cow<'_, str>` for flexible ownership |
// | `number`        | `f64`, `i32`, `u32`               | Context-dependent                         |
// | `boolean`       | `bool`                            | Direct mapping                            |
// | `any`           | `serde_json::Value`               | Dynamic types                             |
// | `Promise<T>`    | `impl Future<Output = Result<T>>` | Async operations                          |
// | `Disposable`    | `Box<dyn Disposable>`             | Trait objects                             |
// | `Event<T>`      | `mpsc::Sender<T>`                 | Reactive programming                      |
// | `URI`           | `Uri`                             | Custom type with conversion methods       |
// | `Position`      | `Position`                        | Struct with line/character                |
// | `Range`         | `Range`                           | Struct with start/end positions           |
// | `TextDocument`  | `dyn TextDocument`                | Trait object interface                    |
// 
// ## Extension Activation Pattern
// 
// ### TypeScript
// 
// ```typescript
// /**
//  * Extension entry point
//  * @param context Extension activation context
//  * @param api Unified VS Code API
//  */
// export function activate(
// 	context: vscode.ExtensionContext,
// 	api: UnifiedVSCodeAPI,
// ): void {
// 	console.log("Extension activated");
// 
// 	// Register command
// 	let disposable = api.commands.registerCommand("extension.hello", () => {
// 		api.window.showInformationMessage("Hello from CodeEditorLand!");
// 	});
// 
// 	context.subscriptions.push(disposable);
// 
// 	// Listen to workspace changes
// 	api.workspace.onDidChangeTextDocument((event) => {
// 		console.log(`Document changed: ${event.document.uri}`);
// 	});
// }
// 
// /**
//  * Extension cleanup
//  */
// export function deactivate(): Thenable<void> | void {
// 	console.log("Extension deactivated");
// }
// ```
// 
