// | **Transport**      | TR     | 🌿 gRPC                 | 💨 IPC                   | ☁️ WASM              |
// | **Backend**        | BE     | 🏔️ Mountain<br/>(Tauri) | VS Code<br/>(Electron)   | Standalone<br/>(Web) |
// | **Frontend**       | FE     | ☁️ Sky<br/>(Astro)      | VS Code UI               | Browser              |
