// # Product Combinatorics
// 
// This directory contains documentation for all possible product combinations and
// configurations of CodeEditorLand.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
// - **Combination Matrix** - Full matrix of all product combinations
// - [Analysis](#analysis)
// - [Priority](#priority)
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// CodeEditorLand's modular architecture enables numerous product combinations
// through the mixing and matching of variants. This directory documents all
// possible combinations and their implementation status.
// 
// ### Core Components
// 
// | Component          | Symbol | Options                                          |
// | ------------------ | ------ | ------------------------------------------------ |
// | **Extension Host** | EH     | Cocoon (Node.js), Grove (Rust/WASM)              |
// | **Transport**      | TR     | gRPC, IPC, WASM                                  |
// | **Backend**        | BE     | Mountain (Tauri), VS Code (Electron), Standalone |
// | **Frontend**       | FE     | Sky (Astro), VS Code UI, Browser                 |
// 
// ### Total Combinations
// 
// ```
// 2 (Extension Host) × 3 (Transport) × 3 (Backend) × 3 (Frontend) = 54 combinations
// ```
