// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # VSCode Build Requirements vs Rest Compiler Capabilities: Gap Analysis
// 
// > **Analysis Date:** 2026-03-05  
// > **Document Type:** Technical Gap Analysis  
// > **Purpose:** Identify capability gaps between VSCode's TypeScript build
// > requirements and Rest compiler's current implementation
// 
// ---
// 
// ## Executive Summary
// 
// This document analyzes the capability gaps between VSCode's
// TypeScript/JavaScript build requirements and the current Rest compiler
// implementation (SWC-based). The Rest compiler provides core transpilation
// capabilities using SWC but lacks several advanced features required for full
// VSCode build compatibility.
// 
// ---
// 
// ## 1. Rest Compiler Architecture Overview
// 
// ### 1.1 Core Components
// 
// | Component    | File Location                                                                                  | Purpose                 |
// | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |
// | **Compiler** | [`Element/Rest/Source/Struct/SWC.rs`](Element/Rest/Source/Struct/SWC.rs:1)                     | Core compilation engine |
// | **Watcher**  | [`Element/Rest/Source/Fn/SWC/Watch.rs`](Element/Rest/Source/Fn/SWC/Watch.rs:1)                 | File system watching    |
// | **Build**    | [`Element/Rest/Source/Fn/SWC/Watch/Compile.rs`](Element/Rest/Source/Fn/SWC/Watch/Compile.rs:1) | Build orchestration     |
// 
// ### 1.2 Current Configuration
// 
// ```rust
// // Element/Rest/Source/Struct/SWC.rs (lines 30-38)
// impl Default for CompilerConfig {
//     fn default() -> Self {
//         Self {
//             Target: "es2022".to_string(),
//             Module: "commonjs".to_string(),
//             Strict: true,
//             EmitDecoratorsMetadata: true,
//         }
//     }
// }
// ```
// 
// ### 1.3 Current Compilation Pipeline
// 
// The Rest compiler applies these transforms in sequence:
// 
// 1. **Resolver** (`swc_ecma_transforms_base::resolver`) - Scope resolution
// 2. **TypeScript Strip** (`swc_ecma_transforms_typescript::strip`) - Remove type
//    annotations
// 3. **Decorators** (`swc_ecma_transforms_proposal::decorators`) - Decorator
//    transformation
// 4. **Helpers Injection** (`swc_ecma_transforms_base::helpers::inject_helpers`) -
//    Runtime helpers
// 
// ---
// 
// ## 2. VSCode Build Requirements
// 
// ### 2.1 TypeScript → JavaScript Transpilation
// 
// - **Requirement:** Full TypeScript to JavaScript compilation
// - **Status:** ✅ Supported via SWC
// 
// ### 2.2 Target: ES2024
// 
// - **Requirement:** Output JavaScript compatible with ES2024 specification
// - **Status:** ⚠️ Partially Supported
// - **Current:** Hardcoded to ES2022 at line 62:
// 
// ```rust
// EsVersion::Es2022,  // Line 62 in Struct/SWC.rs
// ```
// 
// ### 2.3 Module: nodenext
// 
// - **Requirement:** Hybrid ESM + AMD support (CommonJS + ES modules + AMD
//   loaders)
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// - **Current:** Only CommonJS output
// 
// ### 2.4 Decorators Configuration
// 
// - **Requirement:**
//     - `experimentalDecorators: true`
//     - `emitDecoratorMetadata: true`
//     - `useDefineForClassFields: false`
// - **Status:** ⚠️ Partial Support
// - **Current:** `EmitDecoratorsMetadata: true` but
//   `useDefineForClassFields: true` (line 96):
// 
// ```rust
// use_define_for_class_fields: true,  // Should be false for VSCode
// ```
// 
// ### 2.5 Strict Mode
// 
// - **Requirement:** Full TypeScript strict mode
// - **Status:** ✅ Supported
// 
// ### 2.6 esbuild-like Bundling
// 
// - **Requirement:** Combine multiple modules into single/bundled outputs
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// - **Current:** Single-file compilation only
// 
// ### 2.7 Tree-shaking Support
// 
// - **Requirement:** Remove unused code from final bundle
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// - **Note:** SWC has tree-shaking but it's not enabled/configured
// 
// ### 7.8 Minification Support
// 
// - **Requirement:** Compress output JavaScript (remove whitespace, shorten names)
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// 
// ### 2.9 NLS (Localization) Processing
// 
// - **Requirement:** Process National Language Support strings
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// 
// ### 2.10 Private Field Conversion
// 
// - **Requirement:** Convert `#field` syntax to regular properties
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// - **Note:** This is a TypeScript-specific requirement for compatibility
// 
// ### 2.11 Source Map Generation
// 
// - **Requirement:** Generate `.map` files for debugging
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// 
// ### 2.12 AMD Loader Support
// 
// - **Requirement:** Output compatible with AMD loaders (define/require)
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// 
// ### 2.13 Web Worker Compilation
// 
// - **Requirement:** Compile web workers with appropriate optimizations
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// 
// ### 2.14 Multiple Entry Points/Bundling
// 
// - **Requirement:** Support multiple entry points with dependency graph
//   resolution
// - **Status:** ❌ Not Supported
// 
// ---
// 
// ## 3. Detailed Gap Analysis
// 
// ### Gap 1: Target Version (ES2022 → ES2024)
// 
// | Aspect            | Current            | Required      |
// | ----------------- | ------------------ | ------------- |
// | JavaScript Target | ES2022             | ES2024        |
// | Implementation    | Hardcoded in lexer | Configurable  |
// | SWC Support       | Available          | Needs upgrade |
// 
// **Impact:** Medium - SWC supports ES2024, just needs configuration change
// 
// ### Gap 2: Module System (CommonJS → nodenext/AMD)
// 
// | Aspect            | Current       | Required                    |
// | ----------------- | ------------- | --------------------------- |
// | Output Format     | CommonJS only | ESM + CommonJS + AMD hybrid |
// | Module Resolution | Static        | Dynamic + static            |
// | Implementation    | Direct emit   | Complex codegen             |
// 
// **Impact:** High - Requires significant codegen changes
// 
// ### Gap 3: Bundling Capability
// 
// | Aspect                | Current    | Required         |
// | --------------------- | ---------- | ---------------- |
// | File Processing       | One-to-one | Many-to-many     |
// | Dependency Resolution | None       | Full graph       |
// | Import/Export         | Preserved  | Resolved/bundled |
// 
// **Impact:** Critical - Requires new subsystem
// 
// ### Gap 4: Tree-shaking
// 
// | Aspect                | Current | Required      |
// | --------------------- | ------- | ------------- |
// | Dead Code Elimination | None    | Full analysis |
// | Side Effect Detection | None    | Required      |
// | Implementation        | N/A     | SWC has this  |
// 
// **Impact:** Medium - Requires SWC bundler integration
// 
// ### Gap 5: Minification
// 
// | Aspect             | Current | Required         |
// | ------------------ | ------- | ---------------- |
// | Whitespace Removal | None    | Full             |
// | Name Mangling      | None    | Full             |
// | Compression        | None    | Available in SWC |
// 
// **Impact:** Medium - Requires SWC minifier integration
// 
// ### Gap 6: NLS Processing
// 
// | Aspect            | Current | Required |
// | ----------------- | ------- | -------- |
// | String Extraction | None    | Required |
// | Localization Keys | None    | Required |
// | Bundle Generation | None    | Required |
// 
// **Impact:** Low - Separate subsystem needed
// 
// ### Gap 7: Private Field Conversion
// 
// | Aspect            | Current         | Required             |
// | ----------------- | --------------- | -------------------- |
// | `#field` Handling | Preserved as-is | Convert to `__field` |
// | Symbol Conversion | None            | Required             |
// | Transform         | Not implemented | Custom transform     |
// 
// **Impact:** Medium - Custom transform required
// 
// ### Gap 8: Source Map Generation
// 
// | Aspect         | Current        | Required         |
// | -------------- | -------------- | ---------------- |
// | Map Files      | None generated | Full source maps |
// | Mappings       | N/A            | Full             |
// | Implementation | N/A            | Available in SWC |
// 
// **Impact:** Medium - Requires SWC source map integration
// 
// ### Gap 9: AMD Loader Support
// 
// | Aspect             | Current  | Required           |
// | ------------------ | -------- | ------------------ |
// | Output Format      | CommonJS | AMD define/require |
// | Shim Generation    | None     | Required           |
// | Loader Integration | None     | Required           |
// 
// **Impact:** High - New codegen path required
// 
// ### Gap 10: Worker Compilation
// 
// | Aspect                 | Current | Required |
// | ---------------------- | ------- | -------- |
// | Worker Detection       | None    | Required |
// | Special Handling       | None    | Required |
// | Entry Point Generation | None    | Required |
// 
// **Impact:** Medium - Build pipeline enhancement needed
// 
// ---
// 
// ## 4. Gap Summary Matrix
// 
// | #   | Requirement              | Priority | Complexity | Status              |
// | --- | ------------------------ | -------- | ---------- | ------------------- |
// | 1   | ES2024 Target            | Medium   | Low        | 🔴 Config change    |
// | 2   | nodenext Module          | High     | High       | 🔴 New codegen      |
// | 3   | Bundling                 | Critical | Very High  | 🔴 New subsystem    |
// | 4   | Tree-shaking             | Medium   | High       | 🔴 SWC integration  |
// | 5   | Minification             | Medium   | Medium     | 🟡 SWC available    |
// | 6   | NLS Processing           | Low      | Medium     | 🔴 New subsystem    |
// | 7   | Private Field Conversion | Medium   | Medium     | 🔴 Custom transform |
// | 8   | Source Maps              | Medium   | Medium     | 🟡 SWC available    |
// | 9   | AMD Loader Support       | High     | High       | 🔴 New codegen      |
// | 10  | Worker Compilation       | Medium   | Medium     | 🔴 Build pipeline   |
// 
// ---
// 
// ## 5. Recommendations
// 
// ### 5.1 Phase 1: Quick Wins (Low Effort, High Impact)
// 
// 1. **Update Target to ES2024**
//     - Change `EsVersion::Es2022` to `EsVersion::Es2024` in
//       [`Struct/SWC.rs`](Element/Rest/Source/Struct/SWC.rs:62)
//     - Verify SWC version supports ES2024
// 
// 2. **Fix `useDefineForClassFields`**
//     - Change `use_define_for_class_fields: true` to `false` in
//       [`Struct/SWC.rs`](Element/Rest/Source/Struct/SWC.rs:96)
// 
// 3. **Enable Source Map Generation**
//     - Integrate `swc_ecma_codegen::Emitter` with source map configuration
//     - Reference: SWC source map API
// 
// ### 5.2 Phase 2: Core Enhancements (Medium Effort)
// 
// 4. **Add Module Format Options**
//     - Extend `CompilerConfig` with module type selection
//     - Implement ESM output path
//     - Consider AMD hybrid output
// 
// 5. **Enable Tree-shaking**
//     - Integrate SWC's tree-shaking pass
//     - Requires bundler context
// 
// 6. **Add Minification**
//     - Integrate `swc_ecma_minifier` crate
//     - Add minify configuration options
// 
// ### 5.3 Phase 3: Advanced Features (High Effort)
// 
// 7. **Implement Bundling**
//     - This may require integrating esbuild or enhancing SWC usage
//     - Consider using esbuild as the bundler and Rest as the parser/transformer
// 
// 8. **Add Private Field Conversion**
//     - Create custom AST transform to convert `#field` to `__field`
// 
// 9. **Add NLS Processing**
//     - Implement string extraction from TypeScript
//     - Create localization bundle format
// 
// 10. **Add Worker Compilation**
//     - Detect worker files (`*.worker.ts`)
//     - Generate appropriate worker bundles
// 
// ---
// 
// ## 6. Alternative Approach: Hybrid Architecture
// 
// Given the complexity of implementing all VSCode requirements, consider this
// hybrid approach:
// 
// ```
// ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
// │                     Rest Compiler                            │
// ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
// │  TypeScript Parser (SWC)  →  AST Transforms  →  Output     │
// │                                                             │
// │  Current: File-by-file compilation                         │
// │                                                             │
// │  Enhanced: + Source Maps + ES2024 + Module Config          │
// └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
//                               │
//                               ▼
// ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
// │                     esbuild (bundler)                        │
// ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
// │  • Bundling                                                 │
// │  • Tree-shaking                                             │
// │  • Minification                                             │
// │  • Multiple entry points                                   │
// │  • AMD output                                               │
// └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
// ```
// 
// This approach keeps Rest as the TypeScript parser/transformer while leveraging
// esbuild for bundling needs.
// 
// ---
// 
// ## 7. References
// 
// - Rest Compiler Source:
//   [`Element/Rest/Source/Struct/SWC.rs`](Element/Rest/Source/Struct/SWC.rs:1)
