// # VS Code API Compatibility
// 
// Comprehensive matrix of VS Code API implementation status in CodeEditorLand,
// with namespace coverage and implementation details.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
// - [Compatibility Matrix](#compatibility-matrix)
// - [Namespace Coverage](#namespace-coverage)
// - [API Implementation Status](#api-implementation-status)
// - [Extension Compatibility](#extension-compatibility)
// - [API Signature Notes](#api-signature-notes)
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// This document tracks the implementation status of VS Code's extension API in
// CodeEditorLand, using compatibility levels to indicate fully implemented,
// partially supported, or not available features.
// 
// ### Compatibility Legend
// 
// | Symbol     | Status                | Description                              |
// | ---------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
// | ✅ Full    | Fully implemented     | API is fully compatible with VS Code     |
// | 🟡 Partial | Partially implemented | API works with limitations               |
// | ❌ Not     | Not implemented       | API not yet implemented                  |
// | ⏳ Planned | Planned               | API planned for future implementation    |
// | 🔀 Adapter | Adapter needed        | Requires adapter layer for compatibility |
// 
// ### Implementation Goals
// 
// | Goal              | Target        | Current Status |
// | ----------------- | ------------- | -------------- |
// | **Core API**      | 80% coverage  | 🟡 65%         |
// | **Editor API**    | 100% coverage | 🟡 85%         |
// | **Workspace API** | 90% coverage  | 🟡 70%         |
// | **Window API**    | 85% coverage  | 🟡 75%         |
// | **Commands API**  | 100% coverage | 🟡 90%         |
// 
// ## Compatibility Matrix
// 
// ### High-Level API Coverage
// 
// | VS Code Namespace                | Implementation Status | CodeEditorLand Component | Coverage |
// | -------------------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------ | -------- |
// | **vscode.window**                | 🟡 Partial            | Sky UI / Wind            | 75%      |
// | **vscode.workspace**             | 🟡 Partial            | Wind / Sky               | 70%      |
// | **vscode.commands**              | ✅ Full               | Wind / Spine             | 90%      |
// | **vscode.languages**             | 🟡 Partial            | Grove / Sky              | 65%      |
// | **vscode.env**                   | ✅ Full               | Mountain / Wind          | 95%      |
// | **vscode.extensions**            | 🟡 Partial            | Cocoon / Grove           | 80%      |
// | **vscode.debug**                 | ❌ Not                | Planned                  | 0%       |
// | **vscode.scm**                   | 🟡 Partial            | Wind / Sky               | 60%      |
// | **vscode.comments**              | ❌ Not                | Planned                  | 0%       |
// | **vscode.notebooks**             | ❌ Not                | Planned                  | 0%       |
// | **vscode.tasks**                 | 🟡 Partial            | Cocoon                   | 50%      |
// | **vscode.terminal**              | 🟡 Partial            | Cocoon / Sky             | 60%      |
// | **vscode.ui**                    | ⏳ Planned            | Sky                      | 0%       |
// | **vscode.authentication**        | 🟡 Partial            | Wind                     | 40%      |
// | **vscode.workspace.fs**          | ✅ Full               | Wind / Spine             | 100%     |
// | **vscode.languages.\*Providers** | 🟡 Partial            | Grove                    | 55%      |
// 
