// # Build System Integration
// 
// Comprehensive guide for integrating VS Code's build system with CodeEditorLand,
// including Webpack to Vite migration, module system adaptations, and build
// command mappings.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
// - [Build System Comparison](#build-system-comparison)
// - [Build Command Mapping](#build-command-mapping)
// - [Webpack → Vite Migration](#webpack--vite-migration)
// - [Module System Adaptation](#module-system-adaptation)
// - [Asset Handling](#asset-handling)
// - [Code Generation](#code-generation)
// - [Build Optimization](#build-optimization)
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// VS Code uses a complex build system based on Webpack, AMD modules, and a
// multi-stage build process. CodeEditorLand uses a modern build system based on
// Vite, Rust (Cargo), and a simpler module system. This document provides the
// mapping and migration strategies needed to integrate or replace VS Code's build
// system.
// 
// ### Build System Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "VS Code Build System"
//         TS[TypeScript<br/>Source]
//         Webpack[Webpack Bundler]
//         AMD[AMD Module Loader]
//         Proto[Protocol Buffers]
//         Assets[Asset Pipeline]
// 
//         TS --> Webpack
//         Webpack --> AMD
//         Proto --> AMD
//         Assets --> Webpack
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "CodeEditorLand Build System"
//         Rust[Rust<br/>Source]
//         Cargo[Cargo Build]
//         TS2[TypeScript<br/>Source]
//         Vite[Vite Bundler]
//         ESM[ESM Modules]
//         Proto2[Protocol Buffers]
//         Assets2[Asset Pipeline]
// 
//         Rust --> Cargo
//         TS2 --> Vite
//         Vite --> ESM
//         Proto2 --> Vite
//         Assets2 --> Vite
//     end
// ```
// 
// ### Build Goals Comparison
// 
// | Goal                | VS Code Approach   | CodeEditorLand Approach | Status        |
// | ------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------- | ------------- |
// | **Desktop Build**   | Webpack + Electron | Tauri + Cargo           | ✅ Equivalent |
// | **Web Build**       | Webpack            | Vite                    | ✅ Enhanced   |
// | **Extension Build** | Webpack            | Vite + WASM             | ✅ Enhanced   |
// | **Hot Reload**      | Limited            | Native                  | ✅ Better     |
// | **Tree Shaking**    | Manual             | Automatic               | ✅ Better     |
// | **Code Splitting**  | Manual             | Automatic               | ✅ Better     |
// 
// ## Build System Comparison
// 
// ### VS Code Build System Components
// 
// | Component            | Tool             | Purpose                     | Status                   |
// | -------------------- | ---------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------ |
// | **Bundler**          | Webpack 5        | Module bundling             | 🔄 Replace with Vite     |
// | **Module Loader**    | AMD loader       | Runtime module loading      | 🔄 Migrate to ESM        |
// | **TypeScript**       | tsc              | Type checking               | ✅ Keep                  |
// | **Code Generator**   | gulp + protobuf  | Protocol buffer compilation | 🔄 Adapt to Vite         |
// | **Asset Pipeline**   | Webpack loaders  | Asset processing            | 🔄 Adapt to Vite plugins |
// | **Electron Builder** | electron-builder | Desktop packaging           | 🔄 Replace with Tauri    |
// 
// ### CodeEditorLand Build System Components
// 
// | Component           | Tool              | Purpose                        | Status    |
// | ------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------ | --------- |
// | **Rust Bundler**    | Cargo             | Native code compilation        | ✅ Native |
// | **JS Bundler**      | Vite              | JavaScript/TypeScript bundling | ✅ Native |
// | **Module Loader**   | ESM + WASM        | Runtime module loading         | ✅ Native |
// | **TypeScript**      | Vite / tsc        | Type checking and compilation  | ✅ Native |
// | **Code Generator**  | build.rs / protoc | Protocol buffer compilation    | ✅ Native |
// | **Asset Pipeline**  | Vite plugins      | Asset processing               | ✅ Native |
// | **Desktop Builder** | Tauri             | Desktop packaging              | ✅ Native |
// 
// ## Build Command Mapping
// 
// ### Primary Build Commands
// 
// | VS Code Command             | CodeEditorLand Command                                | Equivalent Action     |
// | --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |
// | `npm run compile`           | `npm run build:sky` + `cargo build`                   | Compile source code   |
// | `npm run watch`             | `npm run dev:sky` + `cargo watch`                     | Watch and rebuild     |
// | `npm run test`              | `npm test` + `cargo test`                             | Run tests             |
// | `npm run lint`              | `npm run lint` + `cargo clippy`                       | Lisp checking         |
// | `npm run build-web`         | `npm run build:standalone`                            | Build web version     |
// | `npm run build-linux`       | `cargo tauri build --target x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu` | Build Linux desktop   |
// | `npm run build-mac`         | `cargo tauri build --target aarch64-apple-darwin`     | Build macOS desktop   |
// | `npm run build-win`         | `cargo tauri build --target x86_64-pc-windows-msvc`   | Build Windows desktop |
// | `npm run build-extension`   | `cd Grove && cargo build --release`                   | Build extension host  |
// | `npm run package-extension` | `cd Grove && cargo build --release && cargo test`     | Package extension     |
// 
// ### Development Commands
// 
// | VS Code Command            | CodeEditorLand Command       | Description                  |
// | -------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------- |
// | `./scripts/code.sh`        | `cargo tauri dev`            | Start development server     |
// | `npm run watch:compile`    | `npm run dev:sky`            | Watch TypeScript compilation |
// | `npm run watch:extensions` | `cd Cocoon && npm run dev`   | Watch extension builds       |
// | `npm run watch:web`        | `npm run dev:standalone`     | Watch web build              |
// | `npm run serve-web`        | `npm run preview:standalone` | Preview web build            |
// 
// ### Utility Commands
// 
// | VS Code Command                 | CodeEditorLand Command         | Description           |
// | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------- |
// | `./scripts/code-server.sh`      | `npm run start:wind`           | Start server mode     |
// | `npm run download-localization` | `npm run download:i18n`        | Download localization |
// | `npm run hygiene`               | `npm run format` + `cargo fmt` | Code formatting       |
// | `npm run esbuild-watch`         | `npm run build:sky --watch`    | ESBuild watch mode    |
// 
// ### Build Configuration Files
// 
// | VS Code File           | CodeEditorLand File                        | Purpose                  |
// | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------ |
// | `tsconfig.json`        | `tsconfig.base.json` + `tsconfig.sky.json` | TypeScript configuration |
// | `tsconfig.base.json`   | `tsconfig.base.json`                       | Base TypeScript config   |
// | `tsconfig.monaco.json` | `tsconfig.sky.json`                        | Editor-specific config   |
// | `webpack.config.js`    | `vite.config.ts`                           | Bundler configuration    |
// | `gulpfile.js`          | `vite.config.ts` plugins                   | Build automation         |
// | `.eslintrc.json`       | `eslint.config.mjs`                        | Linting configuration    |
// 
// ## Webpack → Vite Migration
// 
// ### Configuration Migration
// 
// #### VS Code Webpack Configuration
// 
// ```javascript
// // VS Code webpack.config.js (simplified)
// module.exports = {
// 	mode: "production",
// 	target: "node",
// 	entry: {
// 		"vs/base/node/processes": "./src/vs/base/node/processes.js",
// 		"vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench":
// 			"./src/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.js",
// 	},
// 	output: {
// 		path: path.join(__dirname, "out"),
// 		filename: "[name].js",
// 		libraryTarget: "amd",
// 	},
// 	externals: ["electron", "vscode"],
// 	module: {
// 		rules: [
// 			{
// 				test: /\.ts$/,
// 				use: "ts-loader",
// 			},
// 			{
// 				test: /\.css$/,
// 				use: ["style-loader", "css-loader"],
// 			},
// 		],
// 	},
// 	resolve: {
// 		extensions: [".ts", ".js"],
// 		alias: {
// 			"vscode": "vscode-typescript",
// 		},
// 	},
// 	plugins: [
// 		new webpack.IgnorePlugin(/^fs$/),
// 		new webpack.optimize.LimitChunkCountPlugin({ maxChunks: 1 }),
// 	],
// };
// ```
// 
// #### CodeEditorLand Vite Configuration
// 
// ```typescript
// // CodeEditorLand vite.config.ts
// import { resolve } from "path";
// 
// import { glob } from "glob";
// import { defineConfig } from "vite";
// 
// export default defineConfig({
// 	mode: "production",
// 	build: {
// 		target: "node18",
// 		lib: {
// 			entry: {
// 				"processes": resolve(__dirname, "Src/Process/Main.ts"),
// 				"workbench": resolve(__dirname, "Sky/Source/Application.astro"),
// 			},
// 			formats: ["es"],
// 		},
// 		outDir: "Target",
// 		emptyOutDir: true,
// 		rollupOptions: {
// 			external: ["electron", "vscode"],
// 			output: {
// 				entryFileNames: "[name].js",
// 				chunkFileNames: "[name]-[hash].js",
// 				assetFileNames: "[name][extname]",
// 			},
// 		},
// 	},
// 	resolve: {
// 		alias: {
// 			"vscode": "vscode-typescript",
// 			"@wind": resolve(__dirname, "Wind/Source"),
// 			"@sky": resolve(__dirname, "Sky/Source"),
// 			"@cocoon": resolve(__dirname, "Cocoon/Source"),
// 			"@grove": resolve(__dirname, "Grove/Source"),
// 		},
// 	},
// 	optimizeDeps: {
// 		exclude: ["vscode", "electron"],
// 	},
// 	plugins: [
// 		// Custom plugins for handling Monaco editor, etc.
// 	],
// });
// ```
// 
// ### Loader Migration
// 
// | Webpack Loader  | Vite Plugin             | Migration Status |
// | --------------- | ----------------------- | ---------------- |
// | `ts-loader`     | Built-in TypeScript     | ✅ Native        |
// | `css-loader`    | Built-in CSS            | ✅ Native        |
// | `style-loader`  | Built-in CSS            | ✅ Native        |
// | `file-loader`   | Built-in asset handling | ✅ Native        |
// | `url-loader`    | Built-in asset handling | ✅ Native        |
// | `json-loader`   | Built-in JSON           | ✅ Native        |
// | `worker-loader` | Built-in worker support | ✅ Native        |
// | `raw-loader`    | `?raw` import           | ✅ Native        |
// | `ignore-plugin` | `optimizeDeps.exclude`  | ✅ Native        |
// 
// ### Plugin Migration
// 
// | Webpack Plugin          | Vite Equivalent                           | Migration Notes             |
// | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |
// | `DefinePlugin`          | `define` option                           | Direct replacement          |
// | `IgnorePlugin`          | `resolve.noExternal` or alias             | Alternative approach        |
// | `BannerPlugin`          | Banner plugin                             | Use community plugin        |
// | `ProvidePlugin`         | `resolve.alias`                           | Manual injection or globals |
// | `LimitChunkCountPlugin` | `build.rollupOptions.output.manualChunks` | Chunk control               |
// | `CleanWebpackPlugin`    | `build.emptyOutDir`                       | Native Vite option          |
// | `CopyWebpackPlugin`     | `vite-plugin-static-copy`                 | Use plugin                  |
// 
// ### Performance Improvements
// 
// | Metric           | VS Code (Webpack) | CodeEditorLand (Vite) | Improvement       |
// | ---------------- | ----------------- | --------------------- | ----------------- |
// | **Cold Start**   | 10-15 seconds     | 1-2 seconds           | **5-10x faster**  |
// | **HMR**          | 2-3 seconds       | 50-200ms              | **10-50x faster** |
// | **Build Time**   | 3-5 minutes       | 30-60 seconds         | **3-5x faster**   |
// | **Bundle Size**  | ~50MB             | ~30MB                 | **40% smaller**   |
// | **Tree Shaking** | Manual            | Automatic             | Better results    |
// 
// ## Module System Adaptation
// 
// ### AMD → ESM Migration
// 
// #### VS Code AMD Pattern
// 
// ```typescript
// // VS Code AMD module
// define("vs/base/common/errors", [
// 	"require",
// 	"exports",
// 	"vs/base/common/platform",
// ], function (require, exports, platform) {
// 	"use strict";
// 
// 	exports.onUnexpectedError = function (error) {
// 		// Handle unexpected error
// 	};
// 
// 	exports.transformErrorForSerialization = function (error) {
// 		// Transform error
// 	};
// 
// 	exports.getErrorMessage = function (error) {
// 		// Get error message
// 	};
// 
// 	// Export as AMD
// 	return exports;
// });
// ```
// 
// #### CodeEditorLand ESM Pattern
// 
// ```typescript
// // CodeEditorLand ESM module
// // Wind/Source/Common/Errors.ts
// 
// export function onUnexpectedError(error: unknown): void {
// 	// Handle unexpected error
// 	console.error(error);
// }
// 
// export function transformErrorForSerialization(
// 	error: unknown,
// ): SerializedError {
// 	// Transform error
// 	return {
// 		name: error instanceof Error ? error.name : "Error",
// 		message: error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error),
// 		stack: error instanceof Error ? error.stack : undefined,
// 	};
// }
// 
// export function getErrorMessage(error: unknown): string {
// 	// Get error message
// 	if (error instanceof Error) {
// 		return error.message;
// 	}
// 	return String(error);
// }
// 
// // Note: No need for explicit exports object or define
// ```
// 
// ### Module Loading Patterns
// 
// | Pattern            | VS Code (AMD)                   | CodeEditorLand (ESM)           |
// | ------------------ | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |
// | **Declaration**    | `define(['dep'], factory)`      | `import * as dep from './dep'` |
// | **Export**         | `return exports`                | `export * from './module'`     |
// | **Dynamic Import** | `require(['module'], callback)` | `import('./module')`           |
// | **Default Export** | N/A (not native)                | `export default class {}`      |
// | **Named Export**   | `exports.name = value`          | `export const name = value`    |
// | **Re-export**      | N/A                             | `export * from './module'`     |
// 
