// 
// ## Build Optimization
// 
// ### Build Caching
// 
// | Strategy             | VS Code             | CodeEditorLand     | Improvement              |
// | -------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------ |
// | **Type Check Cache** | Limited             | Full TSC cache     | **Faster rebuilds**      |
// | **Module Cache**     | Webpack cache       | Vite esbuild cache | **10x faster**           |
// | **Source Map Cache** | Generated each time | Cached             | **Faster rebuilds**      |
// | **Asset Cache**      | Asset hash          | Content hash       | **Better cache busting** |
// 
// ### Code Splitting Strategies
// 
// **VS Code (Manual):**
// 
// ```javascript
// // VS Code manually specifies chunks
// module.exports = {
// 	optimization: {
// 		splitChunks: {
// 			chunks: "all",
// 			cacheGroups: {
// 				vendor: {
// 					test: /[\\/]node_modules[\\/]/,
// 					name: "vendor",
// 					chunks: "all",
// 				},
// 			},
// 		},
// 	},
// };
// ```
// 
// **CodeEditorLand (Automatic):**
// 
// ```typescript
// // Vite automatically splits by entry and dynamic imports
// // No manual configuration needed for most cases
// 
// export default defineConfig({
// 	build: {
// 		rollupOptions: {
// 			output: {
// 				// Manual chunk control if needed
// 				manualChunks: (id) => {
// 					if (id.includes("node_modules")) {
// 						return "vendor";
// 					}
// 				},
// 			},
// 		},
// 	},
// });
// ```
// 
// ### Bundle Size Optimization
// 
// | Optimization       | VS Code (Webpack) | CodeEditorLand (Vite) | Result          |
// | ------------------ | ----------------- | --------------------- | --------------- |
// | **Tree Shaking**   | Mode: production  | Enabled by default    | Better results  |
// | **Minification**   | TerserPlugin      | esbuild               | **2x faster**   |
// | **Code Splitting** | Manual            | Auto + Manual         | Smaller bundles |
// | **Compression**    | CompressionPlugin | Compress plugin       | Same            |
// | **Source Maps**    | eval-source-map   | inline-source-map     | Better dev      |
// 
// ### Performance Benchmarks
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph LR
//     A[Build Start] --> B{Type Check}
//     B --> C{Bundle}
//     C --> D{Optimize}
//     D --> E[Output]
// 
//     style B fill:#4CAF50
//     style C fill:#4CAF50
//     style D fill:#4CAF50
// 
//     B --> B1[VS Code<br/>30s<br/>CodeEditorLand<br/>5s]
//     C --> C1[VS Code<br/>90s<br/>CodeEditorLand<br/>25s]
//     D --> D1[VS Code<br/>45s<br/>CodeEditorLand<br/>20s]
// 
//     E --> E1[VS Code<br/>165s<br/>CodeEditorLand<br/>50s]
// 
//     style E1 fill:#4CAF50
// ```
