// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # Cross-Variant Compatibility
// 
// Documentation for ensuring compatibility across different product variants of
// CodeEditorLand.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
// - [Compatibility Matrix](#compatibility-matrix)
// - [Portability Guidelines](#portability-guidelines)
// - [Testing Strategy](#testing-strategy)
// - [Migration Paths](#migration-paths)
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// Cross-variant compatibility ensures that CodeEditorLand components can work
// together seamlessly regardless of the specific product configuration.
// 
// ### Goals
// 
// | Goal                   | Description                             |
// | ---------------------- | --------------------------------------- |
// | **API Consistency**    | Consistent APIs across variants         |
// | **Data Compatibility** | Data formats compatible across backends |
// | **Feature Parity**     | Consistent feature set across variants  |
// | **Seamless Migration** | Easy migration between variants         |
// 
// ### Compatibility Dimensions
// 
// | Dimension         | Description                       |
// | ----------------- | --------------------------------- |
// | **API**           | Consistent programming interfaces |
// | **Protocol**      | Vine protocol compatibility       |
// | **Data Format**   | Compatible data structures        |
// | **Configuration** | Cross-variant configuration       |
// | **Extensions**    | Extension portability             |
// 
// ## Compatibility Matrix
// 
// ### Component Compatibility
// 
// | Component         | Desktop (Mountain) | Web (Standalone) | Extension (Cocoon) | Extension (Grove) | Notes                |
// | ----------------- | ------------------ | ---------------- | ------------------ | ----------------- | -------------------- |
// | **Vine Protocol** | ✅                 | ✅               | ✅                 | ✅                | Universal protocol   |
// | **Wind Service**  | ✅                 | ✅               | ✅                 | ✅                | UI service           |
// | **Sky UI**        | ✅                 | ✅               | ⚠️ Limited         | ⚠️ Limited        | Browser constraints  |
// | **Cocoon**        | ✅                 | ⚠️ WASM          | ✅                 | ⚠️ Partial        | JS extensions        |
// | **Grove**         | ✅                 | ✅               | ⚠️ Partial         | ✅                | Rust/WASM extensions |
// | **Mountain**      | ✅                 | ❌ N/A           | ⚠️ IPC             | ⚠️ IPC            | Desktop only         |
// | **Standalone**    | ⚠️ Limited         | ✅               | ⚠️ WASM            | ✅                | Web only             |
// 
// ### Transport Compatibility
// 
// | Transport | Desktop    | Web | Cocoon | Grove | Standalone |
// | --------- | ---------- | --- | ------ | ----- | ---------- |
// | **gRPC**  | ✅         | ✅  | ✅     | ✅    | ✅         |
// | **IPC**   | ✅         | ❌  | ✅     | ✅    | ❌         |
// | **WASM**  | ⚠️ Partial | ✅  | ⚠️     | ✅    | ✅         |
// 
// ### Extension Portability
// 
// | Extension Type | Desktop (Cocoon) | Desktop (Grove) | Web (WASM) | Notes            |
// | -------------- | ---------------- | --------------- | ---------- | ---------------- |
// | **JavaScript** | ✅               | ⚠️ Bridge       | ✅         | Native JS        |
// | **TypeScript** | ✅               | ⚠️ Bridge       | ✅         | Compiled to JS   |
// | **Rust**       | ❌               | ✅ Native       | ✅         | WASM compilation |
// | **C/C++**      | ❌               | ✅ Native       | ✅         | WASM compilation |
// | **Go**         | ❌               | ✅ Native       | ✅         | WASM compilation |
// 
// ## Portability Guidelines
// 
// ### Code Portability
// 
// #### 1. Protocol-Based Communication
// 
// ```typescript
// // ✅ GOOD: Use Vine protocol
// const response = await vineService.request<ResponseType>({
// 	method: "file.read",
// 	params: { path: "./file.txt" },
// });
// 
// // ❌ BAD: Direct file system access
// const content = fs.readFileSync("./file.txt", "utf-8");
// ```
// 
// #### 2. Transport-Agnostic API
// 
// ```typescript
// // ✅ GOOD: Transport-agnostic
// export class FileService {
// 	async readFile(path: string): Promise<string> {
// 		return this.vine.request("file.read", { path });
// 	}
// }
// 
// // ❌ BAD: Transport-specific
// export class FileService {
// 	async readFile(path: string): Promise<string> {
// 		const grpcClient = new GrpcClient("localhost:50051");
// 		return grpcClient.request("file.read", { path });
// 	}
// }
// ```
// 
// #### 3. Environment Detection
// 
// ```typescript
// // ✅ GOOD: Feature detection
// export function supportsIPC(): boolean {
// 	return typeof window === "undefined" && process.platform !== "web";
// }
// 
// // ❌ BAD: Platform assumption
// export function supportsIPC(): boolean {
// 	return process.platform === "darwin" || process.platform === "linux";
// }
// ```
// 
// ### Data Portability
// 
// #### 1. Universal Data Structures
// 
// ```typescript
// // ✅ GOOD: Protocol Buffers definition
// message FileContent {
//   string uri = 1;
//   bytes content = 2;
//   int64 modified = 3;
//   map<string, string> metadata = 4;
// }
// 
// // ❌ BAD: Platform-specific format
// interface FileContent {
//   path: string;      // Windows-style path
//   content: Buffer;   // Node.js Buffer
//   modified: Date;    // JavaScript Date
// }
// ```
// 
// #### 2. Cross-Platform Paths
// 
// ```typescript
// // ✅ GOOD: URI-based paths
// const fileURI = "file:///home/user/project/file.txt";
// 
// // ❌ BAD: Platform-specific paths
// const filePath = "/home/user/project/file.txt"; // Unix
// const filePath = "C:\\Users\\user\\project\\file.txt"; // Windows
// ```
// 
// ### Configuration Portability
// 
// #### 1. Unified Configuration
// 
// ```typescript
// // ✅ GOOD: Variant-agnostic config
// interface EditorConfig {
// 	fontSize: number;
// 	tabSize: number;
// 	wordWrap: boolean;
// 	theme: string;
// }
// 
// // ❌ BAD: Variant-specific config
// interface DesktopConfig {
// 	fontSize: number;
// 	windowPosition: { x: number; y: number };
// 	dockIcon: string;
// }
// ```
// 
// ## Testing Strategy
// 
// ### Compatibility Testing Matrix
// 
// | Test Type             | Desktop | Web | Cocoon     | Grove      | Automation |
// | --------------------- | ------- | --- | ---------- | ---------- | ---------- |
// | **Unit Tests**        | ✅      | ✅  | ✅         | ✅         | 100%       |
// | **Integration Tests** | ✅      | ✅  | ✅         | ✅         | 80%        |
// | **E2E Tests**         | ✅      | ✅  | ⚠️ Partial | ⚠️ Partial | 60%        |
// | **API Tests**         | ✅      | ✅  | ✅         | ✅         | 100%       |
// | **Performance Tests** | ✅      | ✅  | ✅         | ✅         | 100%       |
// 
// ### Test Environments
// 
// ```yaml
// test_environments:
//     - name: Desktop - Mountain
//       os: [windows, macos, linux]
//       backend: mountain
//       transport:
//           - ipc
//           - grpc
// 
//     - name: Web - Standalone
//       browser: [chrome, firefox, safari, edge]
//       transport:
//           - wasm
//           - grpc
// 
//     - name: Extension - Cocoon
//       runtime: nodejs
//       version: [18, 20]
// 
//     - name: Extension - Grove
//       runtime: rust
//       wasm: true
// ```
// 
// ### Compatibility Test Suite
// 
// ```typescript
// // Cross-variant compatibility test
// describe("Vine Protocol Compatibility", () => {
// 	const transports = ["grpc", "ipc", "wasm"];
// 
// 	transports.forEach((transport) => {
// 		describe(`${transport} Transport`, () => {
// 			let vineClient: VineClient;
// 
// 			beforeAll(async () => {
// 				vineClient = new VineClient({ transport });
// 				await vineClient.connect();
// 			});
// 
// 			test("file operations", async () => {
// 				const content = await vineClient.request("file.read", {
// 					path: "/test/file.txt",
// 				});
// 				expect(content).toBeDefined();
// 			});
// 
// 			test("extension execution", async () => {
// 				const result = await vineClient.request("extension.execute", {
// 					extensionId: "test-extension",
// 					command: "test-command",
// 				});
// 				expect(result.success).toBe(true);
// 			});
// 
// 			afterAll(async () => {
// 				await vineClient.disconnect();
// 			});
// 		});
// 	});
// });
// ```
// 
// ## Migration Paths
// 
// ### Desktop → Web
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph LR
//     A[Desktop<br/>Mountain] --> B[Migration]
//     B --> C[Web<br/>Standalone]
// 
//     B --> Data[Data Migration]
//     B --> Config[Config Migration]
//     B --> Ext[Extension Migration]
// 
//     Data --> C
//     Config --> C
//     Ext --> C
// ```
// 
// #### Migration Steps
// 
// **1. Configuration Migration**
// 
// ```typescript
// // Desktop config to Web config
// export function migrateConfig(desktopConfig: DesktopConfig): WebConfig {
// 	return {
// 		editor: {
// 			fontSize: desktopConfig.editor.fontSize,
// 			tabSize: desktopConfig.editor.tabSize,
// 			wordWrap: desktopConfig.editor.wordWrap,
// 		},
// 		ui: {
// 			theme: desktopConfig.editor.theme,
// 			layout: "sidebar-left",
// 		},
// 		features: {
// 			offlineMode: true,
// 			collaboration: desktopConfig.features.cloudSync,
// 		},
// 	};
// }
// ```
// 
// **2. Data Migration**
// 
// ```typescript
// // Desktop data to Web storage
// export async function migrateData(
// 	desktopPath: string,
// 	webStorage: WebStorage,
// ): Promise<void> {
// 	// Read desktop files
// 	const files = await readDirectory(desktopPath);
// 
// 	// Upload to cloud/download locally
// 	for (const file of files) {
// 		const content = await readFile(file.path);
// 		await webStorage.setItem(file.name, content);
// 	}
// }
// ```
// 
// **3. Extension Migration**
// 
// ```typescript
// // Check extension compatibility
// export function canMigrateExtension(manifest: ExtensionManifest): boolean {
// 	// Check dependencies
// 	const incompatibleDeps = manifest.dependencies.filter(
// 		(dep) => dep.startsWith("vscode.") || dep.startsWith("electron."),
// 	);
// 
// 	if (incompatibleDeps.length > 0) {
// 		return false;
// 	}
// 
// 	// Check capabilities
// 	if (manifest.capabilities && manifest.capabilities.requiresNativeModules) {
// 		return false;
// 	}
// 
// 	return true;
// }
// ```
// 
// ### Web → Desktop
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph LR
//     A[Web<br/>Standlone] --> B[Installation]
//     B --> C[Desktop<br/>Mountain]
// 
//     B --> Download[Download App]
//     B --> Sync[Sync Data]
//     B --> Settings[Settings Transfer]
// 
//     Download --> C
//     Sync --> C
//     Settings --> C
// ```
// 
// ### Cocoon → Grove
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     A[Cocoon<br/>Node.js] --> B{Can Migrate?}
//     B --> Yes[Coffee to Rust]
//     B --> No[Keep Cocoon]
// 
//     Yes --> C[Rewrite Logic]
//     Yes --> D[Compile WASM]
//     Yes --> E[Testing]
// 
//     C --> F[Grove<br/>Rust]
//     D --> F
//     E --> F
// ```
// 
// ## Compatibility Guarantees
// 
// ### API Stability
// 
// | Version   | Guarantee                | Duration  |
// | --------- | ------------------------ | --------- |
// | **Major** | Breaking changes allowed | N/A       |
// | **Minor** | Backward compatible      | 6 months  |
// | **Patch** | Backward compatible      | 12 months |
// 
// ### Protocol Compatibility
// 
// | Vine Version | Supported CodeEditorLand Versions |
// | ------------ | --------------------------------- |
// | 1.x.x        | 1.0.0 - 2.0.0                     |
// | 2.x.x        | 2.0.0 - 3.0.0                     |
// 
// ### Deprecation Policy
// 
// 1. **Announcement**: 3 months notice before deprecation
// 2. **Warning**: Deprecation warnings during migration period
// 3. **Removal**: Minimum 6 months after deprecation announcement
// 
