// # VS Code Customization Points
// 
// Documentation for VS Code customization opportunities and how they map to CodeEditorLand, including product configuration, themes, extensions, telemetry, and authentication.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
