// ## Overview
// 
// VS Code provides extensive customization options through product configuration, themes, extensions, and feature flags. CodeEditorLand maintains compatibility with these customization points while offering additional flexibility through its multi-component architecture.
// 
// ### Customization Categories
// 
// | Category | VS Code Approach | CodeEditorLand Approach | Status |
// |----------|-----------------|------------------------|--------|
// | **Product Config** | `product.json` | `Mountain/Config/Product.toml` | ✅ Enhanced |
// | **Themes** | JSON theme files | JSON + CSS + Astro | ✅ Enhanced |
// | **Extensions** | VSIX marketplace | CRX marketplace + WASM | ✅ Enhanced |
// | **Telemetry** | App Insights | Custom telemetry | ✅ Enhanced |
// | **Authentication** | OAuth providers | OAuth providers + WebAuthn | ✅ Enhanced |
// | **Feature Flags** | `argv.json` | `Mountain/Config/Flags.toml` | ✅ Enhanced |
// | **Localization** | NLS system | NLS system + ICU | ✅ Enhanced |
// 
// ## Product Configuration
// 
