// ### Telemetry Events
// 
// | Event Category | VS Code Events | CodeEditorLand Events | Notes |
// |----------------|---------------|----------------------|-------|
// | **Application** | `app_startup`, `app_shutdown` | `app_start`, `app_exit` | ✅ Equivalent |
// | **Editor** | `editor_open`, `editor_close` | `editor_open`, `editor_close` | ✅ Equivalent |
// | **Command** | `command_execute` | `command_execute` | ✅ Equivalent |
// | **Extension** | `extension_activate`, `extension_deactivate` | `extension_activate` | ✅ Equivalent |
// | **Language** | `language_features` | `language_features` | ✅ Equivalent |
// | **Session** | `session_start` | `session_start` | ✅ Equivalent |
// | **Experiment** | `experiment_assign` | `experiment_assign` | ✅ Enhanced |
