// # VS Code Source Integration
// 
// Documentation for integrating with and migrating from Microsoft's Visual Studio
// Code source code.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
// - [Architecture Comparison](#architecture-comparison)
// - [Integration Strategy](#integration-strategy)
// - [API Mapping](#api-mapping)
// - [Migration Guide](#migration-guide)
// - [Extension Adapter](#extension-adapter)
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// This document describes how CodeEditorLand can integrate with Microsoft's VS
// Code source code, leveraging existing components and creating compatibility
// layers for extensions.
// 
// ### Goals
// 
// | Goal                | Description                       |
// | ------------------- | --------------------------------- |
// | **Compatibility**   | Run existing VS Code extensions   |
// | **Migration**       | Gradual migration path for users  |
// | **Component Reuse** | Leverage battle-tested components |
// | **Feature Parity**  | Achieve VS Code feature parity    |
// 
// ### Integration Level
// 
// | Component                    | Integration Level |
// | ---------------------------- | ----------------- |
// | **Editor (Monaco)**          | ✅ Full reuse     |
// | **Extension API**            | 🔄 Adapter layer  |
// | **UI Components**            | ⏳ Partial reuse  |
// | **Language Server Protocol** | ✅ Full support   |
// | **Debug Adapter Protocol**   | 🔄 Planned        |
// 
// ## Architecture Comparison
// 
// ### VS Code Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "VS Code Architecture"
//         Window[Main Process<br/>Electron]
//         Renderer[Renderer Process<br/>UI]
//         ExtensionHost[Extension Host<br/>Node.js]
// 
//         Window --> Renderer
//         Window --> ExtensionHost
//         Renderer --> ExtensionHost
//     end
// ```
// 
// ### CodeEditorLand Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "CodeEditorLand Architecture"
//         Sky[Sky UI<br/>Astro]
//         Mountain[Mountain Backend<br/>Tauri]
//         Cocoon[Cocoon Extension Host<br/>Node.js]
//         Grove[Grove Extension Host<br/>Rust/WASM]
// 
//         Sky --> Mountain
//         Sky --> Cocoon
//         Sky --> Grove
//     end
// ```
// 
// ### Component Mapping
// 
// | VS Code Component  | CodeEditorLand Component | Compatibility           |
// | ------------------ | ------------------------ | ----------------------- |
// | Electron           | Tauri (Mountain)         | Framework compatibility |
// | Monaco Editor      | Monaco (embedded)        | Full compatibility      |
// | Extension Host API | Cocoon API               | Adapter layer           |
// | Workbench          | Sky UI                   | Partial compatibility   |
// | Debug Adapter      | Debug Adapter            | Planned                 |
// 
// ## Integration Strategy
// 
