// ## Data Flow
// 
// ### File Operations Flow
// 
// ```mermaid
// sequenceDiagram
//     participant User as User
//     participant UI as Editor UI
//     participant VFS as Virtual FS
//     participant Cache as Browser Cache
//     participant API as Cloud API
//     participant WS as WebSocket
// 
//     User->>UI: Edit File
//     UI->>UI: Capture Changes
//     UI->>VFS: Write File
//     VFS->>Cache: Update Cache
//     VFS->>WS: Broadcast Change
// 
//     alt Online
//         WS->>API: Sync Changes
//         API-->>WS: Acknowledged
//     else Offline
//         VFS->>VFS: Queue for Sync
//         VFS->>VFS: Mark Pending
//     end
// 
//     UI-->>User: Show Changes
// ```
// 
// ### Collaboration Flow
// 
// ```mermaid
// sequenceDiagram
//     participant User1 as User A
//     participant WS1 as WebSocket A
//     participant Server as Collab Server
//     participant WS2 as WebSocket B
//     participant User2 as User B
// 
//     User1->>WS1: Edit File
//     WS1->>Server: Broadcast Change
//     Server->>WS2: Forward Change
//     WS2->>User2: Apply Change
// 
//     User2->>WS2: Edit File
//     WS2->>Server: Broadcast Change
//     Server->>WS1: Forward Change
//     WS1->>User1: Apply Change
// ```
// 
