// ### Server-Side Scaling
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Scaling Architecture"
//         User[Users] --> CDN[CDN]
//         CDN --> LB[Load Balancer]
// 
//         LB --> Server1[Server 1]
