// ## VS Code API Compatibility
// 
// Standalone mode provides compatibility layers for VS Code APIs, enabling
// existing VS Code extensions to work in web environments.
// 
// ### API Compatibility Matrix
// 
// | VS Code API                              | Standalone Implementation | Compatibility | Notes                        |
// | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------- |
// | `workspace.fs.*`                         | File System Access API    | 🟡 Partial    | Requires user gestures       |
// | `workspace.openTextDocument`             | Monaco Editor + IndexedDB | ✅ Full       | Fully supported              |
// | `workspace.saveAll`                      | IndexedDB + Cloud Sync    | ✅ Full       | With cloud provider          |
// | `window.createTerminal()`                | xterm.js + WebSocket      | ✅ Full       | Full terminal emulation      |
// | `window.showInformationMessage()`        | Custom UI component       | ✅ Full       | Custom notification UI       |
// | `window.createStatusBarItem`             | Sky UI Status Bar         | ✅ Full       | Native component             |
// | `window.createWebviewPanel`              | iframe + postMessage      | ✅ Full       | WebView support              |
// | `env.openExternal`                       | `window.open()`           | 🟡 Partial    | Popup blockers may interfere |
// | `env.clipboard`                          | Clipboard API             | ✅ Full       | HTTPS required               |
// | `env.appName`                            | Constant string           | ✅ Full       | Returns app name             |
// | `commands.registerCommand`               | Local command registry    | ✅ Full       | Full command system          |
// | `workspace.onDidChangeTextDocument`      | Monaco event + WebSocket  | ✅ Full       | Event propagation            |
// | `diagnostics.createDiagnosticCollection` | Monaco diagnostics        | ✅ Full       | LSP diagnostic display       |
// 
