// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// plans/plans/standalone/deployment/README.md
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # Deployment Strategies
// 
// This directory contains comprehensive deployment strategies for CodeEditorLand's
// standalone mode across different platforms and environments.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
// - [Deployment Options](#deployment-options)
// - [Deployment Guides](#deployment-guides)
// - [Best Practices](#best-practices)
// - [Environment Variables](#environment-variables)
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// Standalone mode supports multiple deployment strategies, each optimized for
// specific use cases and target environments:
// 
// | Deployment Type  | Target               | Difficulty | Features                          |
// | ---------------- | -------------------- | ---------- | --------------------------------- |
// | **Static Web**   | CDN                  | Easy       | Basic editor, browser storage     |
// | **PWA**          | Progressive Web App  | Medium     | Offline support, installable      |
// | **Electron**     | Desktop              | Medium     | Native features, full IDE         |
// | **Cloud-Hosted** | Serverless/Container | Hard       | Server-side processing, auth      |
// | **Server-Only**  | Node.js Server       | Medium     | Remote development, team features |
// 
// ## Deployment Options
// 
// ### 1. Static Web Deployment
// 
// Deploy as static assets to any web host with no server-side processing required.
// 
// **Pros:**
// 
// - Zero server costs (e.g., GitHub Pages free tier)
// - Instant deployment
// - CDN distribution
// - Simple maintenance
// 
// **Cons:**
// 
// - Limited to browser capabilities
// - No server-side processing
// - Manual authentication setup
// 
// **See:** [`web.md`](./web.md)
// 
// ### 2. Progressive Web App (PWA)
// 
// Deploy as an installable web application with offline capabilities.
// 
// **Pros:**
// 
// - Works offline
// - Installable on desktop/mobile
// - App-like experience
// - Push notifications
// 
// **Cons:**
// 
// - Service worker complexity
// - Cache management overhead
// - Limited native features
// 
// **See:** [`pwa.md`](./pwa.md)
// 
// ### 3. Electron Desktop App
// 
// Package as a cross-platform desktop application using Electron.
// 
// **Pros:**
// 
// - Native file system access
// - Native terminal integration
// - OS integration
// - Offline by default
// 
// **Cons:**
// 
// - Larger distribution size
// - App store submission required
// - Platform-specific builds
// 
// **See:** [`electron.md`](./electron.md)
// 
// ### 4. Cloud-Hosted
// 
// Deploy with cloud backend for full-featured cloud IDE experience.
// 
// **Pros:**
// 
// - Server-side processing
// - User authentication
// - Cloud storage integration
// - Collaboration features
// 
// **Cons:**
// 
// - Cloud costs
// - Infrastructure management
// - Security considerations
// 
// **See:** [`cloud.md`](./cloud.md)
// 
// ## Deployment Guides
// 
// ### Web Browser Deployment
// 
// [`web.md`](./web.md) - Complete guide for deploying CodeEditorLand as a static
// web application to:
// 
// - Vercel
// - Netlify
// - GitHub Pages
// - AWS S3 + CloudFront
// - Cloudflare Pages
// 
// ### Electron Desktop Deployment
// 
// [`electron.md`](./electron.md) - Complete guide for packaging CodeEditorLand as
// an Electron desktop application:
// 
// - Main process architecture
// - Renderer process configuration
// - Native module integration
// - Auto-update setup
// - Code signing
// 
// ### PWA Deployment
// 
// [`pwa.md`](./pwa.md) - Complete guide for deploying CodeEditorLand as a
// Progressive Web App:
// 
// - Service Worker configuration
// - Manifest generation
// - Offline functionality
// - Push notification setup
// - App installation
// 
// ### Cloud Hosting
// 
// [`cloud.md`](./cloud.md) - Complete guide for cloud-hosted deployments:
// 
// - AWS deployment
// - Google Cloud Platform deployment
// - Azure deployment
// - Serverless functions
// - Container orchestration
// 
// ## Best Practices
// 
// ### 1. Build Optimization
// 
// ```bash
// # Production build
// npm run build:standalone
// 
// # Optimize assets
// npm run optimize:images
// npm run optimize:bundle
// 
// # Generate source maps for debugging
// npm run build:standalone -- --sourcemap
// ```
// 
// ### 2. Environment Configuration
// 
// ```bash
// # Production environment
// NODE_ENV=production
// 
// # API endpoints
// VITE_API_URL=https://api.codeeditorland.com
// VITE_WS_URL=wss://ws.codeeditorland.com
// 
// # Feature flags
// VITE_OFFLINE_MODE=true
// VITE_COLLABORATION=true
// ```
// 
// ### 3. Security Headers
// 
// ```http
// # Apply these headers in production
// Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'...
// X-Frame-Options: DENY
// X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
// Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
// Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
// ```
// 
// ### 4. CDN Configuration
// 
// ```javascript
// // CDN prefetch configuration
// const cdnConfig = {
// 	domains: ["cdn.codeeditorland.com"],
// 	prefetch: ["bundle.js", "bundle.css", "fonts/*"],
// 	preconnect: ["api.codeeditorland.com", "ws.codeeditorland.com"],
// };
// ```
// 
// ## Environment Variables
// 
// ### Required Variables
// 
// | Variable       | Type   | Description            | Example                          |
// | -------------- | ------ | ---------------------- | -------------------------------- |
// | `VITE_API_URL` | string | API endpoint URL       | `https://api.codeeditorland.com` |
// | `VITE_WS_URL`  | string | WebSocket endpoint URL | `wss://ws.codeeditorland.com`    |
// 
// ### Optional Variables
// 
// | Variable             | Type    | Default | Description                    |
// | -------------------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------------ |
// | `VITE_CDN_URL`       | string  | `/`     | CDN base URL for assets        |
// | `VITE_OFFLINE_MODE`  | boolean | `true`  | Enable PWA offline support     |
// | `VITE_COLLABORATION` | boolean | `true`  | Enable real-time collaboration |
// | `VITE_ANALYTICS_ID`  | string  | -       | Analytics tracking ID          |
// | `VITE_SENTRY_DSN`    | string  | -       | Sentry error tracking DSN      |
// 
// ### Development Variables
// 
// | Variable         | Type    | Default | Description              |
// | ---------------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------ |
// | `VITE_DEV_MODE`  | boolean | `false` | Enable development tools |
// | `VITE_MOCK_API`  | boolean | `false` | Use mock API responses   |
// | `VITE_LOG_LEVEL` | string  | `warn`  | Logging verbosity        |
// 
// ## Quick Start
// 
// ### Deploy to Vercel
// 
// ```bash
// # Install Vercel CLI
// npm i -g vercel
// 
// # Deploy
// vercel --prod
// ```
// 
// ### Deploy to Netlify
// 
// ```bash
// # Install Netlify CLI
// npm i -g netlify-cli
// 
// # Build and deploy
// netlify deploy --prod
// ```
// 
// ### Deploy to GitHub Pages
// 
// ```bash
// # Build for GitHub Pages
// npm run build:standalone
// 
// # Deploy using gh-pages
// npm install -g gh-pages
// gh-pages -d dist/standalone
// ```
// 
// ## Related Documentation
// 
// - [Standalone Overview](../README.md)
// - [Standalone Architecture](../architecture.md)
// - [Storage Strategies](../storage/)
// - [API Strategies](../api/)
// - [Security Considerations](../security/)
// 
// ---
// 
// **Last Updated**: 2026-02-07 **Status**: 🔄 In Progress **Maintainer**:
// CodeEditorLand Team

// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// plans/plans/standalone/deployment/web.md
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # Web Browser Deployment
// 
// Complete guide for deploying CodeEditorLand as a static web application to
// various hosting platforms.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
// - [Build Configuration](#build-configuration)
// - [Platform-Specific Deployments](#platform-specific-deployments)
// - [Environment Variables](#environment-variables)
// - [Edge Functions](#edge-functions)
// - [Performance Optimization](#performance-optimization)
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// Web browser deployment provides the fastest and simplest way to make
// CodeEditorLand accessible to users. This approach uses static web hosting with
// no server-side processing required.
// 
// ### Deployment Architecture
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     User[User Browser] --> CDN[CDN/Edge Network]
//     CDN --> StaticAssets[Static Assets<br/>HTML, CSS, JS]
//     CDN --> APIRequests[API Requests]
// 
//     StaticAssets --> BrowserCache[Browser Cache]
// 
//     APIRequests --> APIGateway[API Gateway]
//     APIGateway --> CloudAPI[Cloud API]
//     APIGateway --> WebSocket[WebSocket Server]
// 
//     subgraph "Optional Backend Services"
//         CloudAPI
//         WebSocket
//         Storage[Cloud Storage]
//     end
// ```
// 
// ## Build Configuration
// 
// ### Vite Configuration
// 
// ```javascript
// // vite.config.standalone.js
// import astro from "@astrojs/vite-plugin-astro";
// import { defineConfig } from "vite";
// 
// export default defineConfig({
// 	plugins: [astro()],
// 
// 	build: {
// 		outDir: "dist/standalone",
// 		assetsDir: "assets",
// 		sourcemap: false, // Disable for production
// 		minify: "terser",
// 		terserOptions: {
// 			compress: {
// 				drop_console: true,
// 				drop_debugger: true,
// 				pure_funcs: ["console.log"],
// 			},
// 		},
// 		rollupOptions: {
// 			output: {
// 				manualChunks: {
// 					// Monaco Editor - largest chunk
// 					"monaco-editor": ["monaco-editor"],
// 
// 					// UI components
// 					"ui-components": ["@emotion/react", "@emotion/styled"],
// 
// 					// Utilities
// 					utils: ["lodash", "date-fns"],
// 				},
// 				// Chunk naming for better caching
// 				chunkFileNames: "assets/[name]-[hash].js",
// 				entryFileNames: "assets/[name]-[hash].js",
// 				assetFileNames: "assets/[name]-[hash][extname]",
// 			},
// 		},
// 		chunkSizeWarningLimit: 1000, // 1MB
// 	},
// 
// 	// Server configuration for preview
// 	server: {
// 		port: 3000,
// 		host: true,
// 		open: true,
// 	},
// 
// 	// Preview configuration
// 	preview: {
// 		port: 4173,
// 		host: true,
// 	},
// 
// 	// Optimize dependencies
// 	optimizeDeps: {
// 		include: ["monaco-editor", "xterm"],
// 	},
// });
// ```
// 
// ### Astro Configuration
// 
// ```javascript
// // astro.config.standalone.js
// import react from "@astrojs/react";
// import tailwind from "@astrojs/tailwind";
// import compress from "astro-compress";
// import { defineConfig } from "astro/config";
// 
// export default defineConfig({
