// ## Environment Variables
// 
// ### Required Variables
// 
// | Variable       | Type   | Description            | Example                          |
// | -------------- | ------ | ---------------------- | -------------------------------- |
// | `VITE_API_URL` | string | API endpoint URL       | `https://api.codeeditorland.com` |
// | `VITE_WS_URL`  | string | WebSocket endpoint URL | `wss://ws.codeeditorland.com`    |
// 
// ### Optional Variables
// 
// | Variable             | Type    | Default | Description                    |
// | -------------------- | ------- | ------- | ------------------------------ |
// | `VITE_CDN_URL`       | string  | `/`     | CDN base URL for assets        |
// | `VITE_OFFLINE_MODE`  | boolean | `true`  | Enable PWA offline support     |
// | `VITE_COLLABORATION` | boolean | `true`  | Enable real-time collaboration |
// | `VITE_ANALYTICS_ID`  | string  | -       | Analytics tracking ID          |
// | `VITE_SENTRY_DSN`    | string  | -       | Sentry error tracking DSN      |
// 
