// ### Latency Percentiles
// 
// | Percentile | Description       | Use Case             |
// | ---------- | ----------------- | -------------------- |
// | **p50**    | Median            | Typical performance  |
// | **p90**    | 90th percentile   | Most user experience |
// | **p95**    | 95th percentile   | Performance baseline |
// | **p99**    | 99th percentile   | Outlier detection    |
// | **p99.9**  | 99.9th percentile | Extreme outliers     |
// 
// ### Latency SLO Thresholds
// 
// | Transport Type     | p50 Target | p95 Target | p99 Target |
// | ------------------ | ---------- | ---------- | ---------- |
// | **IPC**            | < 0.1ms    | < 1ms      | < 10ms     |
// | **gRPC (local)**   | < 1ms      | < 10ms     | < 100ms    |
// | **gRPC (network)** | < 10ms     | < 100ms    | < 500ms    |
// | **WASM**           | < 5ms      | < 50ms     | < 200ms    |
// 
// ## Throughput Monitoring
// 
// Throughput metrics measure the rate of requests and data transfer.
// 
// ### Requests Per Second
// 
// **Metric:** `transport_requests_total`
// 
// **Type:** Counter
// 
// **Labels:**
// 
// - `transport` - grpc, ipc, wasm
// - `method` - RPC method name
// - `status` - success or error code
// - `peer` - remote peer address
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Requests per second by transport
// sum(rate(transport_requests_total[1m])) by (transport)
// 
// # Requests per second by method
// sum(rate(transport_requests_total[5m])) by (method)
// 
// # Success rate
// sum(rate(transport_requests_total{status="success"}[5m])) /
// sum(rate(transport_requests_total[5m]))
// ```
// 
// ### Data Transfer Rate
// 
// **Metrics:**
// 
// - `transport_bytes_sent_total` - Bytes sent
// - `transport_bytes_received_total` - Bytes received
// 
// **Type:** Counter
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Megabytes per second sent
// sum(rate(transport_bytes_sent_total[1m])) by (transport) / 1024 / 1024
// 
// # Megabytes per second received
// sum(rate(transport_bytes_received_total[1m])) by (transport) / 1024 / 1024
// 
// # Effective throughput (sent + received)
// sum(
//   rate(transport_bytes_sent_total[1m]) +
//   rate(transport_bytes_received_total[1m])
// ) by (transport) / 1024 / 1024
// ```
// 
// ### Concurrent Connections
// 
// **Metric:** `transport_active_connections`
// 
// **Type:** Gauge
// 
// **Labels:**
// 
// - `transport` - grpc, ipc, wasm
// - `peer` - remote peer address
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Current active connections
// sum(transport_active_connections) by (transport)
// 
// # Max connections over time
// max_over_time(transport_active_connections[1h])
// ```
// 
// ### Rust Throughput Metrics
// 
// ```rust
// use prometheus::{Counter, IntGauge};
// use once_cell::sync::OnceCell;
// 
// static REQUESTS_TOTAL: OnceCell<Counter> = OnceCell::new();
// static BYTES_SENT: OnceCell<Counter> = OnceCell::new();
// static BYTES_RECEIVED: OnceCell<Counter> = OnceCell::new();
// static ACTIVE_CONNECTIONS: OnceCell<IntGauge> = OnceCell::new();
// 
// pub fn record_request(transport: &str, method: &str, status: &str) {
//     REQUESTS_TOTAL.get().unwrap()
//         .with_label_values(&[transport, method, status])
//         .inc();
// }
// 
// pub fn record_bytes_sent(transport: &str, peer: &str, bytes: usize) {
//     BYTES_SENT.get().unwrap()
//         .with_label_values(&[transport, peer])
//         .inc_by(bytes as u64);
// }
// 
// pub fn record_bytes_received(transport: &str, peer: &str, bytes: usize) {
//     BYTES_RECEIVED.get().unwrap()
//         .with_label_values(&[transport, peer])
//         .inc_by(bytes as u64);
// }
// 
// pub fn increment_active_connections(transport: &str, peer: &str) {
//     ACTIVE_CONNECTIONS.get().unwrap()
//         .with_label_values(&[transport, peer])
//         .inc();
// }
// 
// pub fn decrement_active_connections(transport: &str, peer: &str) {
//     ACTIVE_CONNECTIONS.get().unwrap()
//         .with_label_values(&[transport, peer])
//         .dec();
// }
// ```
// 
// ### TypeScript Throughput Metrics
// 
// ```typescript
// import { Counter, Gauge } from "prom-client";
// 
// const requestsTotal = new Counter({
// 	name: "transport_requests_total",
