// ## Error Rate Monitoring
// 
// Error metrics track failures and help identify issues.
// 
// ### Error Counters
// 
// **Metric:** `transport_errors_total`
// 
// **Type:** Counter
// 
// **Labels:**
// 
// - `transport` - grpc, ipc, wasm
// - `error_code` - Unified error code
// - `method` - RPC method name (optional)
// - `component` - Component name
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Errors per second by transport
// sum(rate(transport_errors_total[1m])) by (transport)
// 
// # Errors per second by error code
// sum(rate(transport_errors_total[5m])) by (error_code)
// 
// # Top 5 error codes
// topk(5, sum(rate(transport_errors_total[5m])) by (error_code))
// 
// # Error rate by method
// sum(rate(transport_errors_total[1m])) by (method) /
// sum(rate(transport_requests_total[1m])) by (method)
// ```
// 
// ### Error Rate Dashboard Queries
// 
// ```promql
// # Overall error rate (percentage)
// (
//   sum(rate(transport_errors_total[5m])) /
//   sum(rate(transport_requests_total[5m]))
// ) * 100
// 
// # Error rate by transport
// (
//   sum(rate(transport_errors_total[5m])) by (transport) /
//   sum(rate(transport_requests_total[5m])) by (transport)
// ) * 100
// 
// # Connection errors last hour
// sum(increase(transport_errors_total{error_code=~"CONN.*"}[1h])) by (transport)
// 
// # Timeout errors last hour
// sum(increase(transport_errors_total{error_code="REQUEST_TIMEOUT"}[1h])) by (transport)
// ```
// 
// ### Circuit Breaker Monitoring
// 
// **Metric:** `transport_circuit_breaker_state`
// 
// **Type:** Gauge
// 
// **Values:**
// 
// - 0 = Closed (normal operation)
// - 1 = Open (circuit tripped)
// - 2 = Half-Open (testing recovery)
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Current circuit breaker state
// transport_circuit_breaker_state
// 
// # Circuit breaker open over time
// irate(transport_circuit_breaker_state{state="1"}[5m]) * 60
// 
// # Circuit breaker transitions (state changes)
// changes(transport_circuit_breaker_state[1h])
// ```
// 
// ### Retry Monitoring
// 
// **Metric:** `transport_retries_total`
// 
// **Type:** Counter
// 
// **Labels:**
// 
// - `transport` - grpc, ipc, wasm
// - `method` - RPC method name
// - `attempt` - Retry attempt number
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Retries per second
// sum(rate(transport_retries_total[1m])) by (transport)
// 
// # Retry rate (retries / total requests)
// sum(rate(transport_retries_total[5m])) /
// sum(rate(transport_requests_total[5m]))
// 
// # Average retry attempts per failed request
// sum(rate(transport_retries_total[5m])) /
// sum(rate(transport_errors_total[5m]))
// ```
// 
// ### Rust Error Metrics
// 
// ```rust
// use prometheus::Counter;
// 
// static ERRORS_TOTAL: OnceCell<Counter> = OnceCell::new();
// static RETRIES_TOTAL: OnceCell<Counter> = OnceCell::new();
// 
// pub fn record_error(
//     transport: &str,
//     error_code: &str,
//     method: Option<&str>,
//     component: &str,
// ) {
//     let labels = if let Some(method) = method {
//         vec![transport, error_code, method, component]
//     } else {
//         vec![transport, error_code, "", component]
//     };
// 
//     ERRORS_TOTAL.get().unwrap()
//         .with_label_values(&labels)
//         .inc();
// }
// 
// pub fn record_retry(transport: &str, method: &str, attempt: u32) {
//     RETRIES_TOTAL.get().unwrap()
//         .with_label_values(&[transport, method, &attempt.to_string()])
//         .inc();
// }
// ```
// 
// ### Error Rate Alerts
// 
// | Alert Name               | Condition                            | Severity |
// | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------ | -------- |
// | **High Error Rate**      | Error rate > 5% for 5min             | Warning  |
// | **Critical Error Rate**  | Error rate > 10% for 5min            | Critical |
// | **Connection Failures**  | Connection errors > 1/min for 5min   | Warning  |
// | **Timeout Spike**        | Timeouts > 10/min for 5min           | Warning  |
// | **Circuit Breaker Open** | Circuit breaker state = 1 for >10min | Critical |
// 
// ## Connection Metrics
// 
// Connection metrics track transport connection health and lifecycle.
// 
// ### Connection Establishment
// 
// **Metric:** `transport_connection_establishments_total`
// 
// **Type:** Counter
// 
// **Labels:**
// 
// - `transport` - grpc, ipc, wasm
// - `peer` - remote peer address
// - `status` - success, failed, timeout
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Connection success rate
// sum(rate(transport_connection_establishments_total{status="success"}[5m])) /
// sum(rate(transport_connection_establishments_total[5m]))
// 
// # Failed connections per minute
// sum(rate(transport_connection_establishments_total{status="failed"}[1m]))
// 
// # Connection establishment latency
// histogram_quantile(0.95,
//   sum(rate(transport_connection_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))
//   by (le, transport)
// )
// ```
// 
// ### Connection Pool Metrics
// 
// For transports with connection pooling (gRPC):
// 
// **Metrics:**
// 
// - `transport_pool_connections_active` - Active connections
// - `transport_pool_connections_idle` - Idle connections
// - `transport_pool_connections_max` - Max pool size
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Pool utilization
// transport_pool_connections_active / transport_pool_connections_max
// 
// # Number of idle connections
// sum(transport_pool_connections_idle) by (transport)
// ```
// 
// ### Connection Health
// 
// **Metric:** `transport_connection_healthy`
// 
// **Type:** Gauge
// 
// **Values:**
// 
// - 1 = Healthy
// - 0 = Unhealthy
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Healthy connections
// sum(transport_connection_healthy) by (transport)
// 
// # Unhealthy connections
// sum(1 - transport_connection_healthy) by (transport)
// 
// # Connection health history
// avg_over_time(transport_connection_healthy[1h])
// ```
// 
// ### Rust Connection Metrics
// 
// ```rust
// use prometheus::{IntGauge, Counter};
// 
// static CONNECTION_ESTABLISHMENTS: OnceCell<Counter> = OnceCell::new();
// static CONNECTION_HEALTHY: OnceCell<IntGauge> = OnceCell::new();
// 
// pub fn record_connection_establishment(
//     transport: &str,
//     peer: &str,
//     status: &str,
// ) {
//     CONNECTION_ESTABLISHMENTS.get().unwrap()
//         .with_label_values(&[transport, peer, status])
//         .inc();
// }
// 
// pub fn set_connection_health(transport: &str, peer: &str, healthy: bool) {
//     let value = if healthy { 1 } else { 0 };
//     CONNECTION_HEALTHY.get().unwrap()
//         .with_label_values(&[transport, peer])
//         .set(value);
// }
// ```
// 
// ## Resource Metrics
// 
// Resource metrics track transport resource usage.
// 
// ### Queue Depth
// 
// **Metric:** `transport_queue_depth`
// 
// **Type:** Gauge
// 
// **Labels:**
// 
// - `transport` - grpc, ipc, wasm
// - `queue_type` - request, response, pending
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Current queue depth
// sum(transport_queue_depth) by (transport, queue_type)
// 
// # Max queue depth over time
// max_over_time(transport_queue_depth[1h])
// 
// # Queue depth trend
// predict_linear(transport_queue_depth[10m], 3600)
// ```
// 
// ### Payload Size Distribution
// 
// **Metric:** `transport_payload_size_bytes`
// 
// **Type:** Histogram
// 
// **Labels:**
// 
// - `transport` - grpc, ipc, wasm
// - `direction` - sent, received
// 
// **Buckets:** [16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024, 2048, 4096, 8192, 16384, 32768,
// 65536, 131072, 262144, 524288, 1048576]
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Average payload size
// sum(rate(transport_payload_size_bytes_sum[5m])) /
// sum(rate(transport_payload_size_bytes_count[5m]))
// 
// # P99 payload size
// histogram_quantile(0.99,
//   sum(rate(transport_payload_size_bytes_bucket[5m]))
//   by (le, transport, direction)
// )
// 
// # Large (>1MB) payloads per second
// sum(rate(transport_payload_size_bytes_bucket{le="+Inf"}[1m])) -
// sum(rate(transport_payload_size_bytes_bucket{le="1048576"}[1m]))
// ```
// 
// ### Memory Usage
// 
// **Metrics:**
// 
// - `transport_memory_buffer_bytes` - Buffer memory allocated
// - `transport_memory_pool_bytes` - Pool memory allocated
// - `transport_memory_active_bytes` - Currently in-use memory
// 
// **Example:**
// 
// ```promql
// # Total memory allocated by transport
// sum(transport_memory_buffer_bytes) by (transport)
// 
// # Memory utilization
// sum(transport_memory_active_bytes) / sum(transport_memory_buffer_bytes)
// 
// # Memory trend
// predict_linear(sum(transport_memory_active_bytes)[1h], 3600)
// ```
// 
// ## Health Check Endpoints
// 
// Health check endpoints provide real-time transport status.
// 
// ### Health Check Endpoint Specification
// 
// **Endpoint:** `/health/transport` or `/health/transport/{transport_type}`
// 
// **Method:** GET
// 
// **Response:**
// 
// ```json
// {
// 	"status": "healthy",
// 	"transports": {
// 		"grpc": {
// 			"status": "healthy",
// 			"connected": true,
// 			"latency_ms": 5.2,
// 			"error_rate": 0.01,
// 			"last_error": null,
// 			"connection_age_seconds": 3600
// 		},
// 		"ipc": {
// 			"status": "healthy",
// 			"connected": true,
// 			"latency_ms": 0.1,
// 			"error_rate": 0.0,
// 			"last_error": null,
// 			"connection_age_seconds": 7200
// 		},
// 		"wasm": {
// 			"status": "degraded",
// 			"connected": true,
// 			"latency_ms": 45.8,
// 			"error_rate": 0.05,
// 			"last_error": {
// 				"code": "REQUEST_TIMEOUT",
// 				"message": "Request timeout after 30s",
// 				"timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
// 			},
// 			"connection_age_seconds": 1800
// 		}
// 	},
// 	"overall_status": "degraded",
// 	"timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
// }
// ```
// 
// **Status Values:**
// 
// - `healthy` - All operational
// - `degraded` - Partial functionality
// - `unhealthy` - Non-functional
// 
