// ## Alert Configuration
// 
// ### AlertManager Alerts
// 
// | Alert Name             | Expression                                                                               | For | Severity | Annotations                  |
// | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- | -------- | ---------------------------- |
// | **HighLatency**        | `histogram_quantile(0.99, rate(transport_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) > 1`      | 5m  | warning  | P99 latency exceeds 1s       |
// | **VeryHighLatency**    | `histogram_quantile(0.99, rate(transport_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) > 5`      | 2m  | critical | P99 latency exceeds 5s       |
// | **HighErrorRate**      | `sum(rate(transport_errors_total[5m])) / sum(rate(transport_requests_total[5m])) > 0.05` | 5m  | warning  | Error rate exceeds 5%        |
// | **CriticalErrorRate**  | `sum(rate(transport_errors_total[5m])) / sum(rate(transport_requests_total[5m])) > 0.1`  | 2m  | critical | Error rate exceeds 10%       |
// | **ConnectionFailed**   | `rate(transport_connection_establishments_total{status="failed"}[1m]) > 1`               | 5m  | warning  | Connection failures > 1/min  |
// | **CircuitBreakerOpen** | `transport_circuit_breaker_state == 1`                                                   | 10m | critical | Circuit breaker open > 10min |
// | **NoConnections**      | `sum(transport_active_connections) == 0`                                                 | 1m  | critical | No active connections        |
// | **QueueDepthHigh**     | `transport_queue_depth > 1000`                                                           | 5m  | warning  | Queue depth > 1000           |
// | **MemoryUsageHigh**    | `transport_memory_active_bytes / transport_memory_buffer_bytes > 0.9`                    | 5m  | warning  | Memory usage > 90%           |
// 
