// ## Summary
// 
// The metrics and monitoring strategy provides:
// 
// - **Comprehensive metrics** covering latency, throughput, errors, connections,
//   and resources
// - **Health check endpoints** for real-time status queries
// - **Grafana dashboards** for visualization and monitoring
// - **Alert configuration** for proactive issue detection
// - **Readiness and liveness probes** for orchestration
// - **Cross-language support** with Rust and TypeScript implementations
// - **Minimal performance overhead** with efficient metric collection
// 
// This ensures the transport layer is fully observable and can be monitored
// effectively across all transports (gRPC, IPC, WASM) in CodeEditorLand.

