// ## Transport Migration Paths
// 
// Define migration paths for upgrading or changing transports.
// 
// ### Migration Decision Tree
// 
// ```mermaid
// flowchart TD
//     A[Current Transport] --> B{Target Transport}
// 
//     A -->|gRPC| C{Target?}
//     A -->|IPC| D{Target?}
//     A -->|WASM| E{Target?}
// 
//     C -->|IPC| F[Check Same Process]
//     C -->|WASM| G[Check WASM Support]
// 
//     D -->|gRPC| H[Add Network Support]
//     D -->|WASM| I[Add Browser Support]
// 
//     E -->|gRPC| J[Remove Browser Constraints]
//     E -->|IPC| K[Check Desktop Platform]
// 
//     F -->|Yes| L[Direct Switch]
//     F -->|No| M[Pilot with Fallback]
// 
//     G -->|Yes| N[Gradual Migration]
//     G -->|No| O[Add gRPC-Web Proxy]
// 
//     H --> P[Protocol Adaptation]
//     I --> P
//     J --> P
//     K -->|Yes| L
//     K -->|No| Q[Not Recommended]
// 
//     style L fill:#1dd1a1
//     style M fill:#48dbfb
//     style N fill:#feca57
//     style P fill:#54a0ff
//     style O fill:#ff9ff3
//     style Q fill:#ff6b6b
// ```
// 
// ### Migration Matrix
// 
// | From     | To   | Complexity | Downtime | Strategy           |
// | -------- | ---- | ---------- | -------- | ------------------ |
// | **gRPC** | IPC  | Low        | None     | Dual write, verify |
// | **gRPC** | WASM | Medium     | Low      | Gradual rollout    |
// | **IPC**  | gRPC | Low        | Minimal  | Add gRPC, migrate  |
// | **IPC**  | WASM | High       | Low      | Complete rewrite   |
// | **WASM** | gRPC | Medium     | None     | Add fallback, test |
// | **WASM** | IPC  | High       | Moderate | Desktop-only       |
// 
