// ## Summary
// 
// ### Quick Reference Decision Tables
// 
// #### Environment Selection Quick Reference
// 
// | Environment | Platform                    | Recommended        | Alternative |
// | ----------- | --------------------------- | ------------------ | ----------- |
// | Desktop     | Windows (same-process)      | IPC                | gRPC (Unix) |
// | Desktop     | macOS/Linux (same-process)  | IPC                | gRPC (Unix) |
// | Desktop     | Windows (cross-process)     | gRPC (TCP)         | -           |
// | Desktop     | macOS/Linux (cross-process) | gRPC (Unix Socket) | gRPC (TCP)  |
// | Web         | Modern browser              | WASM + WebSocket   | gRPC-Web    |
// | Web         | Legacy browser              | gRPC-Web           | XHR + JSON  |
// | Server      | Kubernetes                  | gRPC + mTLS        | IPC         |
// | Server      | Bare Metal                  | gRPC or IPC        | -           |
// 
// #### Performance Selection Quick Reference
// 
// | Latency | Throughput | Streaming | Recommended |
// | ------- | ---------- | --------- | ----------- |
// | < 1ms   | Any        | No        | IPC         |
// | < 10ms  | > 10 MB/s  | No        | IPC         |
// | < 50ms  | Any        | Any       | gRPC or IPC |
// | < 100ms | Any        | Any       | Any         |
// | > 100ms | Any        | Any       | Any         |
// 
// #### Feature Selection Quick Reference
// 
// | Required Features         | Recommended  |
// | ------------------------- | ------------ |
// | Streaming (server)        | gRPC or WASM |
// | Streaming (bidirectional) | gRPC or WASM |
// | Zero-copy                 | WASM         |
// | Type safety + code gen    | gRPC or WASM |
// | Browser native            | WASM         |
// | High throughput local     | IPC          |
// | Cross-network             | gRPC         |
// 
