// ## Performance
// 
// ### Performance Characteristics
// 
// | Metric            | Target | Notes                  |
// | ----------------- | ------ | ---------------------- |
// | **Latency (P50)** | < 2ms  | Local network          |
// | **Latency (P95)** | < 10ms | Local network          |
// | **Throughput**    | 10MB/s | Per connection         |
// | **Connections**   | 1,000  | Max concurrent         |
// | **Streams**       | 10,000 | Max concurrent streams |
// 
// ### Optimization Strategies
// 
// #### 1. Connection Pooling
// 
// ```typescript
// export class GrpcConnectionPool {
// 	private pool: Map<string, GrpcClient> = new Map();
// 	private maxSize: number;
// 	private currentSize = 0;
