// ## Comparison: IPC vs gRPC
// 
// | Feature              | IPC        | gRPC           |
// | -------------------- | ---------- | -------------- |
// | **Latency**          | < 0.1ms    | 1-2ms          |
// | **Throughput**       | 500MB/s    | 10MB/s         |
// | **Network**          | Local only | Local + Remote |
// | **Streaming**        | ⚠️ Limited | ✅ Full        |
// | **Language Support** | Good       | Excellent      |
// | **Complexity**       | Medium     | Low            |
