// ## Best Practices
// 
// ### When to Use Each Transport
// 
// | Situation                    | Recommended Transport | Reasoning                       |
// | ---------------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------- |
// | Same-process, high-frequency | IPC                   | Maximum performance             |
// | Cross-process, local machine | gRPC                  | Good performance, full features |
// | Cross-network                | gRPC                  | Only option for cross-network   |
// | Web application              | WASM                  | Browser-native                  |
// | Web without WASM             | gRPC-Web              | Fallback option                 |
// | Real-time streaming          | gRPC or WASM          | Both support streaming          |
// | Mobile app                   | gRPC                  | Cross-platform support          |
// 
// ### Performance Considerations
// 
// ```typescript
