// 
// ### Registry Lifecycle
// 
// ```mermaid
// stateDiagram-v2
//     [*] --> Uninitialized
//     Uninitialized --> Registering: register()
//     Registering --> Idle: Registration Complete
// 
//     Idle --> Connecting: select() or autoSelect()
//     Connecting -- Success --> Active
//     Connecting -- Failure --> Idle
// 
//     Active --> Disconnecting: disconnect()
//     Disconnecting --> Idle
// 
//     Active --> Switching: select() with new transport
//     Switching --> Disconnecting: Disconnect old
//     Switching --> Connecting: Connect new
// 
//     Idle --> Unregistering: unregister()
//     Unregistering --> [*]
// ```
// 
// ### Registry Metrics
// 
// The registry provides metrics for monitoring:
// 
// ```rust
// pub struct RegistryMetrics {
//     pub registered_transports: HashMap<String, TransportStatus>,
//     pub active_transport: Option<String>,
