// ## Performance
// 
// ### Performance Characteristics
// 
// | Metric                    | Target           | Notes             |
// | ------------------------- | ---------------- | ----------------- |
// | **WASM Compilation**      | < 100ms          | Small modules     |
// | **Function Call Latency** | < 1ms            | Function overhead |
// | **Computation Speed**     | 50-80% of native | WASM vs native    |
// | **Memory Overhead**       | < 10MB           | Base WASM runtime |
// | **Message Passing**       | < 5ms            | Worker messages   |
// 
// ### Optimization Strategies
// 
// #### 1. WASM Module Streaming
