// ### Environment Variables
// 
// | Variable             | Description     | Default                      |
// | -------------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------- |
// | `AIR_DAEMON_ENABLED` | Enable daemon   | `true`                       |
// | `AIR_LOG_LEVEL`      | Logging level   | `info`                       |
// | `AIR_CACHE_DIR`      | Cache directory | `~/.codeeditorland/cache`    |
// | `AIR_DATA_DIR`       | Data directory  | `~/.codeeditorland/data`     |
// | `AIR_SOCKET_PATH`    | IPC socket path | `~/.codeeditorland/air.sock` |
