// ## Security
// 
// ### Security Model
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Daemon Zone"
//         Air[Air Daemon]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Client Zone"
//         Mountain[Mountain Backend]
//         Cocoon[Cocoon Host]
//         Grove[Grove Host]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Protected Resources"
//         FS[File System]
//         Net[Network]
//         Cache[Cache Storage]
//     end
// 
//     Mountain -->|Vine + Auth| Air
//     Cocoon -->|Vine + Auth| Air
//     Grove -->|Vine + Auth| Air
// 
//     Air --> FS
//     Air --> Cache
//     Air --> Net
// ```
// 
// ### Security Features
// 
// | Feature            | Description                    | Status     |
// | ------------------ | ------------------------------ | ---------- |
// | **Authentication** | Client authentication for Vine | 🔄 Planned |
// | **Authorization**  | RBAC for services              | 🔄 Planned |
// | **Secure IPC**     | Encrypted IPC communication    | 🔄 Planned |
// | **Sandboxed Jobs** | Job execution sandboxing       | 🔄 Planned |
// | **Audit Logging**  | Comprehensive audit trail      | 🔄 Planned |
// 
