// | **Search Latency**   | < 100ms            | File search results      |
// | **Cache Hit Rate**   | > 80%              | Memory cache efficiency  |
// | **Memory Usage**     | < 1GB              | Base daemon memory       |
// | **CPU Usage**        | < 5%               | Idle baseline            |
// 
