// ```
// 
// ### Environment Variables
// 
// | Variable              | Description          | Default                        |
// | --------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------ |
// | `CEL_EXTENSION_HOST`  | Extension host type  | `grove`                        |
// | `CEL_EXTENSIONS_PATH` | Extensions directory | `~/.codeeditorland/extensions` |
// | `CEL_LOG_LEVEL`       | Logging level        | `info`                         |
// | `CEL_DEV_MODE`        | Development mode     | `false`                        |
// | `CEL_WASM_ENGINE`     | WASM engine choice   | `wasmtime`                     |
// 
// ## Performance
// 
// ### Performance Characteristics
// 
// | Metric                     | Target       | Notes                     |
// | -------------------------- | ------------ | ------------------------- |
// | **Extension Startup**      | < 200ms      | Rust extension load time  |
// | **WASM Extension Startup** | < 300ms      | WASM compilation + load   |
// | **Command Execution**      | < 50ms       | User-facing commands      |
// | **Language Service**       | < 20ms       | Completion, hover         |
// | **Memory Usage**           | < 50MB       | Base memory per extension |
// | **Throughput**             | 10k+ ops/sec | High-frequency operations |
// 
// ### Optimization Strategies
// 
// #### 1. Zero-Copy Operations
// 
// ```rust
// // Avoid copying data when possible
// pub fn process_buffer(buffer: &[u8]) -> Result<ProcessedData> {
//     // Use slice reference directly
//     let header = parse_header(buffer)?;
//     let body = &buffer[header.size..];
//     Ok(ProcessedData { header, body })
// }
// ```
// 
// #### 2. Parallel Processing
// 
// ```rust
// use rayon::prelude::*;
// 
// pub fn process_files(files: Vec<String>) -> Vec<ProcessResult> {
//     files.par_iter()
//         .map(|file| process_file(file))
//         .collect()
// }
// ```
// 
// #### 3. WASM Optimization
// 
// ```toml
// # Optimize WASM output
// [package.metadata.wasm-pack.profile.release]
// wasm-opt = ['-O4', '--enable-mutable-globals']
// ```
// 
// #### 4. Lazy Evaluation
// 
// ```rust
// pub struct LazyProcessor {
//     data: Option<ProcessedData>,
//     source: String,
// }
// 
// impl LazyProcessor {
//     pub fn get_data(&mut self) -> &ProcessedData {
//         self.data.get_or_insert_with(|| process_source(&self.source))
//     }
// }
// ```
// 
// ## Roadmap
// 
// ### Phase 1: Foundation (Planned)
// 
// - ⏳ Core extension host
// - ⏳ Rust Native API
// - ⏳ WASM runtime integration
// - ⏳ Basic sandbox implementation
// 
// ### Phase 2: Enhancement (Planned)
// 
// - ⏳ Enhanced permission system
// - ⏳ WASM optimization
// - ⏳ Interop with Cocoon
// - ⏳ Extension marketplace support
// 
// ### Phase 3: Advanced (Planned)
// 
// - ⏳ WASI support
// - ⏳ Advanced debugging tools
// - ⏳ Performance profiling
// - ⏳ Multi-threading for extensions
// 
// ### Phase 4: Future
// 
// - ⏳ GPU acceleration
// - ⏳ Distributed extensions
// - ⏳ Machine learning runtime
// - ⏳ Edge computing support
// 
// ## Comparison: Grove vs Cocoon
// 
// | Aspect               | Grove (Rust/WASM)       | Cocoon (Node.js)   |
// | -------------------- | ----------------------- | ------------------ |
// | **Performance**      | Excellent (2-5x faster) | Good               |
// | **Memory**           | Efficient (5-10x less)  | Higher usage       |
// | **Startup Time**     | Fast                    | Moderate           |
// | **Ecosystem**        | Growing crates.io       | Massive npm        |
// | **Learning Curve**   | Higher                  | Lower              |
// | **Safety**           | Memory-safe             | Runtime checks     |
// | **Interoperability** | WASM, C/C++             | JavaScript/TS      |
// | **Use Case**         | Performance-critical    | General extensions |
// 
