// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// # 🏔️ Mountain: Native Backend
// 
// Mountain is the Tauri-based native backend for CodeEditorLand, providing desktop
// application capabilities with Rust's performance and safety.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
// - [Architecture](#architecture)
// - [API Surface](#api-surface)
// - [Configuration](#configuration)
// - [Security](#security)
// - [Performance](#performance)
// - [Roadmap](#roadmap)
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// Mountain serves as the native backend for CodeEditorLand desktop applications,
// built on Tauri framework with Rust. It provides system-level access, native UI
// windows, and bridges between the frontend and operating system.
// 
// ### Key Features
// 
// - ✅ Tauri-based desktop application framework
// - ✅ Native file system access
// - ✅ Process management
// - ✅ System tray integration
// - ✅ Native window management
// - ✅ Cross-platform support (Windows, macOS, Linux)
// 
// ### Design Goals
// 
// | Goal                   | Description                                       |
// | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
// | **Native Performance** | System-level performance with minimal overhead    |
// | **Security**           | Sandboxed frontend with controlled backend access |
// | **Cross-Platform**     | Support for major desktop platforms               |
// | **Small Bundle Size**  | Efficient distribution                            |
// | **Modern Rust**        | Leverage Rust's safety and ecosystem              |
// 
// ### Use Cases
// 
// | Scenario                   | Description                                  |
// | -------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
// | **Desktop Application**    | Primary deployment target for CodeEditorLand |
// | **File System Operations** | Native file access and management            |
// | **Process Management**     | Spawn and manage external processes          |
// | **System Integration**     | System tray, notifications, native dialogs   |
// | **Extension Hosting**      | Run extension hosts (Cocoon, Grove)          |
// 
// ## Architecture
// 
// ### Component Design
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Mountain Backend"
//         subgraph "Tauri Core"
//             App[Tauri Application]
//             Windows[Window Manager]
//             IPC[Tauri IPC]
//         end
// 
//         subgraph "Process Management"
//             CocoonMgr[Cocoon Manager]
//             GroveMgr[Grove Manager]
//             ProcessPool[Process Pool]
//         end
// 
//         subgraph "System Services"
//             FileSystem[File System Service]
//             Network[Network Service]
//             ProcessService[Process Service]
//             Notification[Notification Service]
//             Config[Configuration Service]
//         end
// 
//         subgraph "Protocol Layer"
//             Vine[Vine Protocol Server]
//             Transports[Transport Implementations]
//         end
//     end
// 
//     App --> Windows
//     Windows --> IPC
//     IPC --> Vine
//     Vine --> Transports
//     Transports --> CocoonMgr
//     Transports --> GroveMgr
//     CocoonMgr --> ProcessPool
//     GroveMgr --> ProcessPool
// 
//     Vine --> FileSystem
//     Vine --> Network
//     Vine --> ProcessService
//     Vine --> Notification
//     Vine --> Config
// ```
// 
// ### Startup Sequence
// 
// ```mermaid
// sequenceDiagram
//     participant User as User
//     participant App as Tauri App
//     participant Config as Config Service
//     participant Vine as Vine Protocol
//     participant Cocoon as Cocoon Manager
//     participant Grove as Grove Manager
//     participant UI as Frontend
// 
//     User->>App: Launch Application
//     App->>Config: Load Configuration
//     Config-->>App: Configuration Loaded
//     App->>Vine: Start Protocol Server
//     Vine-->>App: Server Ready
//     App->>Cocoon: Start Extension Host
//     Cocoon-->>App: Extension Host Ready
//     App->>Grove: Start Extension Host
//     Grove-->>App: Extension Host Ready
//     App->>UI: Initialize Frontend
//     UI-->>App: Frontend Ready
//     App-->>User: Application Ready
// ```
// 
// ### Request Flow
// 
// ```mermaid
// sequenceDiagram
//     participant UI as Frontend (Sky)
//     participant Vine as Vine Protocol
//     participant Service as System Service
//     participant ExtHost as Extension Host
//     participant OS as Operating System
// 
//     UI->>Vine: Request
//     Vine->>Service: Check Service Request?
//     alt System Service
//         Service->>OS: Native Operation
//         OS-->>Service: Result
//         Service-->>Vine: Response
//     else Extension Operation
//         Vine->>ExtHost: Forward Request
//         ExtHost->>ExtHost: Execute Extension
//         ExtHost-->>Vine: Response
//     end
//     Vine-->>UI: Response
// ```
// 
