// ## Security
// 
// ### Security Model
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Sandboxed Frontend"
//         UI[Web Content]
//         JS[JavaScript]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Tauri Bridge"
//         Bridge[Tauri IPC]
//         Permission[Permission Layer]
//     end
// 
//     subgraph "Secure Backend"
//         Rust[Rust Code]
//         FS[File System]
//         Net[Network]
//     end
// 
//     UI --> Bridge
//     JS --> Bridge
//     Bridge --> Permission
//     Permission -.->|Allowed| Rust
//     Permission -.x|Denied| Rust
//     Rust --> FS
//     Rust --> Net
// ```
// 
// ### Security Features
// 
// | Feature                      | Description                         | Status     |
// | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------- |
// | **Sandboxed Frontend**       | Web content runs in sandbox         | ✅ Active  |
// | **Permission Layer**         | Fine-grained permission control     | ✅ Active  |
// | **CSP Headers**              | Content Security Policy enforcement | ✅ Active  |
// | **Code Signing**             | Application signing for trust       | 🔄 Planned |
// | **Secure Updates**           | Signed update mechanism             | ✅ Active  |
// | **Local Storage Encryption** | Encrypted configuration             | 🔄 Planned |
// 
// ### Permission Model
// 
