// ## Performance
// 
// ### Performance Characteristics
// 
// | Metric              | Target  | Notes                       |
// | ------------------- | ------- | --------------------------- |
// | **Startup Time**    | < 3s    | Application launch to ready |
// | **Window Open**     | < 500ms | New window creation         |
// | **File Operations** | < 100ms | Read/write typical files    |
// | **Process Spawn**   | < 200ms | Extension host startup      |
// | **Memory Usage**    | < 200MB | Base application memory     |
// | **Bundle Size**     | < 50MB  | Application installer       |
// 
// ### Optimization Strategies
// 
// #### 1. Lazy Loading
// 
// ```rust
// pub struct LazyService<T> {
//     service: Arc<RwLock<Option<T>>>,
//     factory: Box<dyn Fn() -> T + Send + Sync>,
