// # ☁️ Sky: UI Components
// 
// Sky is the component library and frontend layer for CodeEditorLand, providing a
// modern, performant user interface built on Astro and TypeScript.
// 
// ## 📑 Table of Contents
// 
// - [Overview](#overview)
// - [Architecture](#architecture)
// - [Component Library](#component-library)
// - [Layout System](#layout-system)
// - [Theming](#theming)
// - [Configuration](#configuration)
// - [Performance](#performance)
// - [Roadmap](#roadmap)
// 
// ## Overview
// 
// Sky is the modern UI component library and frontend layer for CodeEditorLand,
// built with Astro for performance and TypeScript for type safety. It provides a
// complete set of reusable UI components.
// 
// ### Key Features
// 
// - ✅ Astro-based framework
// - ✅ TypeScript-first architecture
// - ✅ Component library
// - ✅ Responsive layouts
// - ✅ Dark/light theme support
// - ✅ Accessibility compliance
// 
// ### Design Goals
// 
// | Goal                     | Description                               |
// | ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |
// | **Performance**          | Fast render times and minimal bundle size |
// | **Type Safety**          | Full TypeScript support                   |
// | **Accessibility**        | WCAG 2.1 compliant                        |
// | **Customization**        | Themable and extensible                   |
// | **Developer Experience** | Excellent tooling and DX                  |
// 
// ### Use Cases
// 
// | Scenario               | Description                |
// | ---------------------- | -------------------------- |
// | **Editor UI**          | Main editor interface      |
// | **Panels and Views**   | Side panels, bottom panels |
// | **Dialogs and Modals** | User prompts and forms     |
// | **Status Bar**         | Application status display |
// | **Settings UI**        | Configuration interface    |
// 
// ## Architecture
// 
// ### Component Design
// 
// ```mermaid
// graph TB
//     subgraph "Sky UI Layer"
//         subgraph "Core Components"
//             Layout[Layout Components]
//             Editor[Editor Components]
//             Panels[Panel Components]
//             Dialogs[Dialog Components]
//             Status[Status Components]
//         end
// 
//         subgraph "Foundation"
//             Theme[Theme System]
//             Icons[Icon System]
//             Typography[Typography System]
//             Spacing[Spacing System]
//         end
// 
//         subgraph "Utilities"
//             RTL[RTL Support]
//             Accessibility[A11y Utilities]
//             Animations[Animation Library]
//         end
//     end
// 
//     Foundation --> Layout
//     Foundation --> Editor
//     Foundation --> Panels
//     Foundation --> Dialogs
//     Foundation --> Status
// 
//     Utilities --> Layout
//     Utilities --> Editor
//     Utilities --> Panels
// ```
// 
// ### Component Hierarchy
// 
// ```mermaid
// classDiagram
//     class Component {
//         <<abstract>>
//         +render()
//         +mount()
//         +unmount()
//     }
// 
//     class LayoutComponent {
//         +render()
//         +setSize()
//         +getPosition()
//     }
// 
//     class EditorComponent {
//         +render()
//         +setContent()
//         +getSelection()
//     }
// 
//     class PanelComponent {
//         +render()
//         +show()
//         +hide()
//     }
// 
//     class ModalComponent {
//         +render()
//         +open()
//         +close()
//     }
// 
//     Component <|-- LayoutComponent
//     Component <|-- EditorComponent
//     Component <|-- PanelComponent
//     Component <|-- ModalComponent
// ```
// 
// ### Render Flow
// 
// ```mermaid
// sequenceDiagram
//     participant User as User
//     participant Sky as Sky Component
//     participant Wind as Wind Service
//     participant Astro as Astro Framework
// 
//     User->>Sky: Interaction
//     Sky->>Wind: Request Data
//     Wind-->>Sky: Response Data
//     Sky->>Astro: Update State
//     Astro->>Astro: Re-render
//     Astro-->>User: Updated UI
// ```
// 
// ## Component Library
// 
