// ### Phase 2: Enhancement (In Progress)
// 
// - ⏳ IPC transport implementation
// - ⏳ WASM transport implementation
// - ✅ Streaming support
// - ⏳ Better error handling
// 
// ### Phase 3: Advanced (Planned)
// 
// - ⏳ Version migration tools
// - ⏳ Protocol documentation generator
// - ⏳ Performance profiling
// - ⏳ Security extensions (encryption, auth)
// 
// ### Phase 4: Future
// 
// - ⏳ QUIC transport support
// - ⏳ WebRTC transport
// - ⏳ Distributed protocol
// - ⏳ Machine learning extensions
// 
// ## Best Practices
// 
// ### Message Design
// 
// 1. **Use proto3 syntax** - Cleaner and more modern
// 2. **Define clear service boundaries** - Logical separation
// 3. **Include request IDs** - For tracing and debugging
// 4. **Handle errors properly** - Include error codes and details
// 5. **Support streaming** - For real-time operations
// 
// ### Performance
// 
// 1. **Reuse message objects** - Reduce allocations
// 2. **Compress large payloads** - Use gzip or similar
// 3. **Message batching** - Group related operations
// 4. **Connection pooling** - Reuse connections
// 
// ### Security
// 
// 1. **Validate all inputs** - Never trust external input
// 2. **Use TLS** - For network communications
// 3. **Implement rate limiting** - Prevent abuse
// 4. **Authenticate messages** - Verify message sources
// 
