// ## Performance
// 
// ### Performance Characteristics
// 
// | Metric                | Target  | Notes                   |
// | --------------------- | ------- | ----------------------- |
// | **Request Latency**   | < 50ms  | P50 request time        |
// | **Cache Hit Rate**    | > 85%   | Memory cache efficiency |
// | **State Update Time** | < 10ms  | State synchronization   |
// | **Event Delivery**    | < 5ms   | Event propagation       |
// | **Memory Usage**      | < 100MB | Base service memory     |
// 
// ### Optimization Strategies
// 
