// 
// ## 3. Workbench Variants Comparison
// 
// ### 3.1 Browser Workbench Entry Point
// 
// **Source**:
// [`Dependency/Microsoft/Dependency/Editor/src/vs/workbench/browser/web.main.ts`](../../Dependency/Microsoft/Dependency/Editor/src/vs/workbench/browser/web.main.ts)
// 
// **Key Imports**:
// 
// ```typescript
// import {
// 	BrowserWorkbenchEnvironmentService,
// 	IBrowserWorkbenchEnvironmentService,
// } from "../services/environment/browser/environmentService.js";
// import { Workbench } from "./workbench.js";
// ```
// 
// **Environment Service**: `BrowserWorkbenchEnvironmentService`
// 
// - **File System**: Uses browser APIs (IndexedDB, File System Access API)
// - **IPC**: Uses remote agent via WebSocket
// - **Configuration**: Uses browser storage APIs
// - **Platform**: Web/Browser
// 
// ### 3.2 Electron Workbench Entry Point
// 
// **Source**:
// [`Dependency/Microsoft/Dependency/Editor/src/vs/workbench/electron-browser/desktop.main.ts`](../../Dependency/Microsoft/Dependency/Editor/src/vs/workbench/electron-browser/desktop.main.ts)
// 
// **Key Imports**:
// 
// ```typescript
// import { Workbench } from "../browser/workbench.js";
// import {
// 	INativeWorkbenchEnvironmentService,
// 	NativeWorkbenchEnvironmentService,
// } from "../services/environment/electron-browser/environmentService.js";
// import { NativeWindow } from "./window.js";
// ```
// 
// **Environment Service**: `NativeWorkbenchEnvironmentService`
// 
// - **File System**: Uses `DiskFileSystemProvider` (Node.js fs module)
// - **IPC**: Uses Electron's `ipcRenderer`
// - **Configuration**: Uses native file system
// - **Platform**: Electron
// 
// ### 3.3 Comparison Table
// 
// | Feature           | Browser Workbench          | Electron Workbench      | Native Wind Workbench    |
// | ----------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------- | ------------------------ |
// | **File System**   | IndexedDB/HTML5 FSA        | Node.js `fs`            | Mountain gRPC            |
// | **IPC**           | Remote Agent (WebSocket)   | Electron `ipcRenderer`  | Tauri IPC                |
// | **Configuration** | Browser Storage            | Native Files            | Mountain Configuration   |
// | **Extensions**    | Remote                     | Local Process           | Cocoon (gRPC)            |
// | **Terminal**      | xterm.js (limited)         | Node pty                | PTY via Mountain         |
// | **Protocol**      | `file://`, `vscode-web://` | `vscode-file://`        | `file://` (via Mountain) |
// | **CSP**           | Compatible                 | ❌ Requires vscode-file | Compatible               |
// | **Native APIs**   | None                       | Extensive               | Wind Preload Polyfill    |
// 
