// ## 4. Architecture Deep Dive
// 
// ### 4.1 Component Overview
// 
// ```
// ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
// │                        Presentation Layer                       │
// ├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┤
// │   Sky (Astro UI)     │            Wind (Effect-TS Services)      │
// │                      │                                          │
// │  - Workbench Pages   │  - Editor Service                        │
// │  - Components        │  - File System Service                   │
// │  - NLS               │  - Command Service                       │
// └──────────┬───────────┴───────────────────┬──────────────────────┘
//            │                               │
//            │ Service Calls                 │ Tauri IPC
//            v                               v
// ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
// │                      Orchestration Layer                        │
// ├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┤
// │   Mountain (Tauri)   │              Air (Daemon)                 │
// │                      │                                          │
// │  - gRPC Server       │  - Background Tasks                      │
// │  - File System       │  - Health Monitoring                     │
// │  - Terminal PTY      │  - Indexing                              │
// │  - Command Registry  │  - Data Persistence                      │
// │  - UI Window         │                                          │
// └──────────┬───────────┴───────────────────┬──────────────────────┘
//            │                               │
//            │ gRPC                          │ gRPC
//            v                               v
// ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
// │                        Extension Layer                          │
// ├──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────┤
// │   Cocoon (Extension  │            Vine (Protocol)                │
// │   Host)              │                                          │
// │                      │  - ProtoBuf Definitions                   │
// │  - VSCode API Shim   │  - gRPC Service Contracts                │
// │  - Extension Loader  │  - Message Serialization                  │
// │  - Provider Registry │                                          │
// └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
// ```
// 
// ### 4.2 Mountain - Native Backend
// 
// **Location**: [`Element/Mountain/Source/`](../../Element/Mountain/Source/)
// 
// **Key Modules**:
// 
// | Module                | Responsibility             | Location                                 |
// | --------------------- | -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
// | **Vine/Server**       | gRPC Server Implementation | `Vine/Server/MountainVinegRPCService.rs` |
// | **IPC**               | Tauri IPC Handlers         | `IPC/WindServiceHandlers.rs`             |
// | **FileSystem**        | File System Operations     | `FileSystem/FileExplorerViewProvider.rs` |
// | **Command**           | Command Execution          | `Command/`                               |
// | **ProcessManagement** | Cocoon Process Management  | `ProcessManagement/CocoonManagement.rs`  |
// 
// **Key Findings**:
// 
// 1. **gRPC Server** (`MountainVinegRPCService`):
//     - Handles requests from Cocoon
//     - Implements bidirectional communication
//     - Services: `process_cocoon_request`, `send_cocoon_notification`,
//       `cancel_operation`
// 
// 2. **IPC Layer** (`WindServiceHandlers`):
//     - Handles Tauri IPC commands from Wind
//     - Maps TypeScript service calls to Rust implementations
//     - Categories:
//         - Configuration: `configuration:get`, `configuration:update`
//         - File System: `file:read`, `file:write`, `file:stat`, etc.
//         - Storage: `storage:get`, `storage:set`
//         - Native: `native:showItemInFolder`, `native:openExternal`
// 
// 3. **Service Integration**:
//     - Uses dependency injection via `Requires` trait
//     - Providers: `ConfigurationProvider`, `FileSystemProvider`, etc.
//     - Error handling with detailed context
// 
// ### 4.3 Wind - UI Service Layer
// 
// **Location**: [`Element/Wind/Source/`](../../Element/Wind/Source/)
// 
// **Key Modules**:
// 
// | Module            | Responsibility         | Location                              |
// | ----------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
// | **Preload**       | Electron API Polyfill  | `Preload.ts`, `Function/Install.ts`   |
// | **IPC**           | Tauri IPC Service      | `IPC/Live.ts`                         |
// | **Configuration** | Configuration Service  | `Configuration/Implementation/`       |
// | **FileSystem**    | File System Service    | (not found - may need implementation) |
// | **Mountain**      | Mountain Communication | `Mountain/Implementation/`            |
// 
// **Key Findings**:
// 
// 1. **Preload Polyfill**
//    ([`Function/Install.ts`](../../Element/Wind/Source/Function/Install.ts)):
//     - Creates VSCode-compatible `window.vscode` object
//     - Implements Electron IPC shim using Taur
//     - Provides `process` polyfill
//     - Attaches `preloadGlobals` for Effect-TS
// 
// 2. **Effect-TS Structure**:
//     - Service interfaces in `Interface/`
//     - Implementations in `Implementation/`
//     - Live layers in `Layer/`
//     - Mock layers for testing
// 
// 3. **Available Services**:
//     - ActivityBar, Sidebar, Panel, StatusBar (UI services)
//     - Configuration, Clipboard, Environment
//     - Health, IPC, Mountain, NetworkRestrictions
// 
// 4. **Missing Services**:
//     - Complete FileSystem service implementation
//     - Editor service implementation
//     - Language feature services
// 
// ### 4.4 Cocoon - Extension Host
// 
// **Location**: [`Element/Cocoon/Source/`](../../Element/Cocoon/Source/)
// 
// **Key Services** (from documentation):
// 
// | Service                  | Responsibility                         |
// | ------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |
// | **ExtensionHostService** | Extension lifecycle management         |
// | **GRPCServerService**    | gRPC client for Mountain communication |
// | **IPCService**           | IPC abstraction and routing            |
// | **Command**              | Command execution                      |
// | **Configuration**        | Configuration management               |
// | **FileSystemService**    | File system API implementation         |
// | **Workspace**            | Workspace management                   |
// 
// **Key Features**:
// 
// - Runs as separate Node.js sidecar process
// - Provides complete VSCode API compatibility
// - Communicates with Mountain via gRPC
// - Implements extension activation lifecycle
// 
// ### 4.5 Air - Background Daemon
// 
// **Location**: [`Element/Air/Source/`](../../Element/Air/Source/)
// 
// **Key Services**:
// 
// - Health Check
// - Logging
// - Resilience (circuit breaker, retry, timeout)
// - Indexing
// - Configuration
// - Authentication
// - Metrics
// - Tracing
// 
// **Purpose**: Long-running background operations, independent of Mountain main
// process.
// 
