// ### 11.3 Glossary
// 
// | Term              | Definition                                                  |
// | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
// | **Air**           | Background daemon for long-running operations               |
// | **Cocoon**        | Extension host (Node.js process)                            |
// | **CSP**           | Content Security Policy                                     |
// | **Electron**      | Desktop application framework (chromium + Node.js)          |
// | **gRPC**          | Remote Procedure Call framework using Protocol Buffers      |
// | **IPC**           | Inter-Process Communication                                 |
// | **Monaco Editor** | VSCode's code editor component                              |
// | **Mountain**      | Native backend (Rust + Tauri)                               |
// | **Polyfill**      | Code that provides functionality not natively available     |
// | **ProtoBuf**      | Protocol Buffers - serialization format                     |
// | **Sky**           | UI layer (Astro components)                                 |
// | **Tauri**         | Desktop application framework (web frontend + Rust backend) |
// | **Vine**          | gRPC protocol definitions                                   |
// | **VSCode**        | Visual Studio Code - code editor by Microsoft               |
// | **Wind**          | UI service layer (Effect-TS)                                |
// | **vscodium**      | Open-source build of VSCode with telemetry removed          |
// | **workbench**     | VSCode's main editor UI container                           |
// 
